(1365761, 174320, 22479, '<td valign="top">What a delight for the senses. I particularly like the haziness in the center, as if something is on the verge of materializing. <br/> <br/>Not a huge fan of the border however, particularly since it is not a uniform border all the way around, but thicker left/right than top/bottom. A simple, uniform white border of about 8-10 pixels all the way around would work best here.<br/> <br/>Overall a great entry and the border is not that distracting. Well done.</td>', 'What a delight for the senses. I particularly like the haziness in the center, as if something is on the verge of materializing.  Not a huge fan of the border however, particularly since it is not a uniform border all the way around, but thicker left/right than top/bottom. A simple, uniform white border of about 8-10 pixels all the way around would work best here. Overall a great entry and the border is not that distracting. Well done.', '2005-05-06 01:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
