(1366521, 174446, 32767, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny but a little cheesy. The lighting does the image some injustice as it takes away from the dreamy feel. The shadow is good but the room in that back shouldn''t be in view. I''d might suggest next time, try a white or black background. Cheers.</td>', 'Pretty funny but a little cheesy. The lighting does the image some injustice as it takes away from the dreamy feel. The shadow is good but the room in that back shouldn''t be in view. I''d might suggest next time, try a white or black background. Cheers.', '2005-05-06 09:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1366523, 172377, 32767, '<td valign="top">I think the image is pretty good. I''m giving you a 9 mostly because I have that same dream almost every night. Good call.</td>', 'I think the image is pretty good. I''m giving you a 9 mostly because I have that same dream almost every night. Good call.', '2005-05-06 09:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1366525, 173886, 37031, '<td valign="top">i think your shot is really good, however I believe it would have been GREAT if you had left the little chain out. It draws the eye</td>', 'i think your shot is really good, however I believe it would have been GREAT if you had left the little chain out. It draws the eye', '2005-05-06 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
