(1366542, 174691, 35804, '<td valign="top">Cool image...I''m really appreciating these few images that have made an effort to be creative. I like the simplicity of this picture, the smoke/fog photographed beautifully. The somewhat worrysome look on the models face is very effective. The only problem I can see people picking on is in the lower right hand side, an angular looking shadow...I can''t tell what it is, I don''t know if it''s there on purpose...but I have made it into a obscured tower/antenna of some sort, he is sitting on a cloud after all.  : }</td>', 'Cool image...I''m really appreciating these few images that have made an effort to be creative. I like the simplicity of this picture, the smoke/fog photographed beautifully. The somewhat worrysome look on the models face is very effective. The only problem I can see people picking on is in the lower right hand side, an angular looking shadow...I can''t tell what it is, I don''t know if it''s there on purpose...but I have made it into a obscured tower/antenna of some sort, he is sitting on a cloud after all.  : }', '2005-05-06 09:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1366549, 174620, 32767, '<td valign="top">The image could have been better leveled. Good work...you did capture a nice dreamy feel.</td>', 'The image could have been better leveled. Good work...you did capture a nice dreamy feel.', '2005-05-06 10:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
