(1366949, 172472, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharpness and composition. Good concept for the challenge. Very stark looking light that perhaps suits the interpretation. But the sky looks over blue and the sand looks under yellow. Good work, though. 8</td>', 'Lovely sharpness and composition. Good concept for the challenge. Very stark looking light that perhaps suits the interpretation. But the sky looks over blue and the sand looks under yellow. Good work, though. 8', '2005-05-06 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
