(1366955, 172613, 2798, '<td valign="top">Some DPCers *are* flower lovers. I love the shot despite it not being strictly on-challenge. Colours look muted in this shot - I see pinks and creams and burgundies that could have been brought out more. Also the crop is a little static. Good light and tone with nice sharpness. And what is with the : in the title?? 8</td>', 'Some DPCers *are* flower lovers. I love the shot despite it not being strictly on-challenge. Colours look muted in this shot - I see pinks and creams and burgundies that could have been brought out more. Also the crop is a little static. Good light and tone with nice sharpness. And what is with the : in the title?? 8', '2005-05-06 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
