(1366998, 174696, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well thought out image, and certainly a vision of paradise as we know it.  I wonder just a bit about the umbrella.  The color is fine, of course, but does one really want to shield oneself from paradise?  Still, a fine interpretation of the Challenge.</td>', 'Well thought out image, and certainly a vision of paradise as we know it.  I wonder just a bit about the umbrella.  The color is fine, of course, but does one really want to shield oneself from paradise?  Still, a fine interpretation of the Challenge.', '2005-05-06 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
