(1367011, 173506, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice free-form sculpture.  Maybe, for some, a little too much in Photoshop (or equivalent) filters.  But lovely colors.</td>', 'Nice free-form sculpture.  Maybe, for some, a little too much in Photoshop (or equivalent) filters.  But lovely colors.', '2005-05-06 12:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367023, 174661, 7743, '<td valign="top">Camera movement during exposure can produce some very interesting effects.  This image feels a little out of balance.  This could be due to the juxtaposition of the light and dark areas of the image.  In general, light areas on top and dark areas on the bottom work best however in this image I think having the lighter area in the bottom right would improve the impact of the image.</td>', 'Camera movement during exposure can produce some very interesting effects.  This image feels a little out of balance.  This could be due to the juxtaposition of the light and dark areas of the image.  In general, light areas on top and dark areas on the bottom work best however in this image I think having the lighter area in the bottom right would improve the impact of the image.', '2005-05-06 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367038, 174687, 7743, '<td valign="top">When zooming during exposure the subject always ends up dead center.  Not a bad thing however I think the impact of this image could be improved if the focal point were more to the left and closer to the bottom. 9</td>', 'When zooming during exposure the subject always ends up dead center.  Not a bad thing however I think the impact of this image could be improved if the focal point were more to the left and closer to the bottom. 9', '2005-05-06 12:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367043, 174301, 7743, '<td valign="top">The detail in the clouds is very dramatic.  You''ve got great contrast between the tree and the sky.  A lower horizon may make the image even more dramatic.</td>', 'The detail in the clouds is very dramatic.  You''ve got great contrast between the tree and the sky.  A lower horizon may make the image even more dramatic.', '2005-05-06 12:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
