(1367359, 172472, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo! Just love the way you caught the guy throwing the sand, looks like a ghost forming and lifting up it''s arms...</td>', 'This is a great photo! Just love the way you caught the guy throwing the sand, looks like a ghost forming and lifting up it''s arms...', '2005-05-06 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367362, 174248, 31443, '<td valign="top">Meaningful, well composed, lighting is good, overall a great shot, well done!</td>', 'Meaningful, well composed, lighting is good, overall a great shot, well done!', '2005-05-06 14:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367369, 173506, 31443, '<td valign="top">I keep wondering what animal''s eye this is. Very unusual image, the colors are beautiful, overall minimalist but elegant, like this alot....</td>', 'I keep wondering what animal''s eye this is. Very unusual image, the colors are beautiful, overall minimalist but elegant, like this alot....', '2005-05-06 14:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367372, 172293, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, I hope you tell us how you lit up the flowers, would love to try something like this when my Lilies flower......</td>', 'Very pretty, I hope you tell us how you lit up the flowers, would love to try something like this when my Lilies flower......', '2005-05-06 14:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367386, 174485, 31443, '<td valign="top">The sofa looks suspended in mid-air, like the overall setup, wish the kona would have looked away from the camera, maybe closed her eyes..don''t know..</td>', 'The sofa looks suspended in mid-air, like the overall setup, wish the kona would have looked away from the camera, maybe closed her eyes..don''t know..', '2005-05-06 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367388, 173338, 24065, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea for the challenge.  I love the reflection of the sky in the wet sand.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to have a little more space in front of the child and perhaps a little higher angle so you could see the footprints better.  But, hey, what do I know? I''ve never ribboned!!  :)  -9-</td>', 'Excellent idea for the challenge.  I love the reflection of the sky in the wet sand.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to have a little more space in front of the child and perhaps a little higher angle so you could see the footprints better.  But, hey, what do I know? I''ve never ribboned!!  :)  -9-', '2005-05-06 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367390, 174691, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge.  And well executed IMO.  -9-  Good luck :)</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge.  And well executed IMO.  -9-  Good luck :)', '2005-05-06 14:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367395, 172694, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, dreamy quality.  A great entry for the challenge IMO.  -9-</td>', 'Beautiful, dreamy quality.  A great entry for the challenge IMO.  -9-', '2005-05-06 14:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367397, 173989, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge and beautiful lighting!  One of my favorites! -9-</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge and beautiful lighting!  One of my favorites! -9-', '2005-05-06 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367401, 174301, 34481, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky, I don''t really care for the soft focus corners, but I realize you did this to create the drim effect.  Nice image.</td>', 'beautiful sky, I don''t really care for the soft focus corners, but I realize you did this to create the drim effect.  Nice image.', '2005-05-06 14:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367403, 174530, 24065, '<td valign="top">You and I have a similar entry, altho I believe yours is a notch up from mine! :)  I''m not doing as well as I had hoped with it.  I hope my "9" will help out your average if you''re suffering from the "don''t like soft focus" crowd!</td>', 'You and I have a similar entry, altho I believe yours is a notch up from mine! :)  I''m not doing as well as I had hoped with it.  I hope my "9" will help out your average if you''re suffering from the "don''t like soft focus" crowd!', '2005-05-06 14:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367407, 174066, 31443, '<td valign="top">A lovely view and dreamy yes....</td>', 'A lovely view and dreamy yes....', '2005-05-06 14:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367409, 174505, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea for the challenge!  There''s something I don''t like about the gentleman''s clothing, but I can''t "put my finger on" exactly what it is.  I think it may be the colors.  Anyway, it''s lovely and very appropriate for the challenge.  -9-</td>', 'This is an excellent idea for the challenge!  There''s something I don''t like about the gentleman''s clothing, but I can''t "put my finger on" exactly what it is.  I think it may be the colors.  Anyway, it''s lovely and very appropriate for the challenge.  -9-', '2005-05-06 14:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367412, 174620, 24065, '<td valign="top">An excellent idea for the challenge!  I would have given it a 10 if it had been level.  -9-  Best of luck!  :)</td>', 'An excellent idea for the challenge!  I would have given it a 10 if it had been level.  -9-  Best of luck!  :)', '2005-05-06 14:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367414, 174074, 31443, '<td valign="top">Hopefully this one comes true :) nice shot</td>', 'Hopefully this one comes true :) nice shot', '2005-05-06 14:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367418, 174693, 18080, '<td valign="top">Nice idea<br/>BUT... I think i can see all the cloning out you have done to get rid of the thread.<br/>Good BW treatment<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Nice ideaBUT... I think i can see all the cloning out you have done to get rid of the thread.Good BW treatmentGood luck', '2005-05-06 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367438, 173500, 7743, '<td valign="top">The motion of the ducks if interesting.  The hand is distracting maybe due to overprocessing.  It doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image.</td>', 'The motion of the ducks if interesting.  The hand is distracting maybe due to overprocessing.  It doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image.', '2005-05-06 14:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367439, 174415, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the glow effect here.</td>', 'I really like the glow effect here.', '2005-05-06 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367443, 172590, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the lady''s face.</td>', 'Great expression on the lady''s face.', '2005-05-06 14:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367451, 174320, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy, although I find the colours of the ground a little overdone.</td>', 'Very dreamy, although I find the colours of the ground a little overdone.', '2005-05-06 14:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367456, 173379, 24212, '<td valign="top">I quite like this high-key shot, although I find that the neckline of the shirt in the bottom right corner intrudes a bit.</td>', 'I quite like this high-key shot, although I find that the neckline of the shirt in the bottom right corner intrudes a bit.', '2005-05-06 14:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367470, 174609, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract, but there appears to be some noise in the darker reds. Was this intentional, or a product of the processing?</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract, but there appears to be some noise in the darker reds. Was this intentional, or a product of the processing?', '2005-05-06 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367471, 172180, 27562, '<td valign="top">Under advanced editing rules you can correct the obvious perspective distortion so the buildings won''t look like they are falling over.  Good work otherwise.</td>', 'Under advanced editing rules you can correct the obvious perspective distortion so the buildings won''t look like they are falling over.  Good work otherwise.', '2005-05-06 15:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367474, 173250, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an interesting sky. I''d love to find out how it was done.</td>', 'Wow, that''s an interesting sky. I''d love to find out how it was done.', '2005-05-06 15:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367476, 174547, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The only critical comment I could make would be that the two people are not in step, now that''s really being petty.</td>', 'I really like this. The only critical comment I could make would be that the two people are not in step, now that''s really being petty.', '2005-05-06 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1367478, 174400, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice zoom distortion (I asume, If not done in photoshop).  So far one of the better in the dream challenge.</td>', 'Nice zoom distortion (I asume, If not done in photoshop).  So far one of the better in the dream challenge.', '2005-05-06 15:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367480, 174485, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think the lighing is great. It really looks as though the sofa is floating.</td>', 'I think the lighing is great. It really looks as though the sofa is floating.', '2005-05-06 15:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367481, 173541, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the background shot and the idea for the ghostly image, although I feel that the ghostly image itself is a little too insubstantial.</td>', 'I like the background shot and the idea for the ghostly image, although I feel that the ghostly image itself is a little too insubstantial.', '2005-05-06 15:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367482, 173977, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great set up, wonderful lighting.</td>', 'Great set up, wonderful lighting.', '2005-05-06 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367484, 174364, 24212, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an album cover I saw somewhere. The harsh lighting really helps accentuate the unnatural feel.</td>', 'This reminds me of an album cover I saw somewhere. The harsh lighting really helps accentuate the unnatural feel.', '2005-05-06 15:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367485, 173619, 19010, '<td valign="top">I think I can grasp the concept you were going for from the title. However without it I would have no idea what I was looking at. There''s a strong chance it has a little to do with my work monitor. The image is almost all black. There are a few strange colored shapes. After a few minutes I was able to figure out that what i was looking at was blue jeans and some hands. I feel that you were on to a great idea but it lost all of its substance in the darkness.</td>', 'I think I can grasp the concept you were going for from the title. However without it I would have no idea what I was looking at. There''s a strong chance it has a little to do with my work monitor. The image is almost all black. There are a few strange colored shapes. After a few minutes I was able to figure out that what i was looking at was blue jeans and some hands. I feel that you were on to a great idea but it lost all of its substance in the darkness.', '2005-05-06 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367486, 174697, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and great lighting, but I question your perspective.  The out of focus background "rabbit ears" interrupt the main subject.</td>', 'Nice subject and great lighting, but I question your perspective.  The out of focus background "rabbit ears" interrupt the main subject.', '2005-05-06 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367497, 174643, 27562, '<td valign="top">Love the lithographic feel of the image.  Great concept &amp; execution.</td>', 'Love the lithographic feel of the image.  Great concept & execution.', '2005-05-06 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367509, 174620, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the floor. It really seems to lead the eye to the window.</td>', 'I like the detail in the floor. It really seems to lead the eye to the window.', '2005-05-06 15:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367510, 173867, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the model is wonderful, but I feel that the lighting is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'I like the pose and the model is wonderful, but I feel that the lighting is a bit too harsh.', '2005-05-06 15:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367514, 174429, 24212, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly sharp and DOF spot-on. You do, however, have really weird dreams.</td>', 'Brilliantly sharp and DOF spot-on. You do, however, have really weird dreams.', '2005-05-06 15:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367517, 174081, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great picture. Can''t for the life of me begin to understand the meaning, though. Love the way that the subjects stand out.</td>', 'A great picture. Can''t for the life of me begin to understand the meaning, though. Love the way that the subjects stand out.', '2005-05-06 15:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367518, 173514, 24212, '<td valign="top">I konw that this is meant to be ''dreamy'', but I feel that it''s a bit too soft-focus.</td>', 'I konw that this is meant to be ''dreamy'', but I feel that it''s a bit too soft-focus.', '2005-05-06 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367519, 173176, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I don''t feel that noise in a picture works well with such a subject.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I don''t feel that noise in a picture works well with such a subject.', '2005-05-06 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367522, 174691, 24212, '<td valign="top">Gread lighting and the clouds are really well done. Perhaps a little too much motion in the ''clouds'' at the top.</td>', 'Gread lighting and the clouds are really well done. Perhaps a little too much motion in the ''clouds'' at the top.', '2005-05-06 15:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367524, 174074, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, although, in such a shot as this, I''d like to see all the petals in sharp focus, whereas the ones in the lower left are a little soft. The rest of the flower is wondefullly sharp, though.</td>', 'Nicely done, although, in such a shot as this, I''d like to see all the petals in sharp focus, whereas the ones in the lower left are a little soft. The rest of the flower is wondefullly sharp, though.', '2005-05-06 15:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367527, 172832, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great sharpness, great crop. What more could I say?</td>', 'Great lighting, great sharpness, great crop. What more could I say?', '2005-05-06 15:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367529, 173644, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wonder whether this would look better with the shelf on the bottom cropped off.</td>', 'I wonder whether this would look better with the shelf on the bottom cropped off.', '2005-05-06 15:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367532, 174224, 24212, '<td valign="top">I dont know what effects have been applied here, but I assume that a dreamy impression was the goal. I feel that the effect may need to be a little stronger, as, at a first glance, I thought this was just over sharpened.</td>', 'I dont know what effects have been applied here, but I assume that a dreamy impression was the goal. I feel that the effect may need to be a little stronger, as, at a first glance, I thought this was just over sharpened.', '2005-05-06 15:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367534, 174083, 24212, '<td valign="top">A real ''old world'' feel evoked with this shot. The parts that matter are superbly sharp.</td>', 'A real ''old world'' feel evoked with this shot. The parts that matter are superbly sharp.', '2005-05-06 15:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367539, 174643, 24212, '<td valign="top">I hope you realize that you had me hanging upside-down in an attempt to see what the subject might be. One of the strangest dog pictures I''ve ever seen. The lighting and colour really give this a ''dream sequence'' feel.</td>', 'I hope you realize that you had me hanging upside-down in an attempt to see what the subject might be. One of the strangest dog pictures I''ve ever seen. The lighting and colour really give this a ''dream sequence'' feel.', '2005-05-06 15:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367543, 174400, 24212, '<td valign="top">This effect is brilliently done. I feel as though I am falling into the frame.</td>', 'This effect is brilliently done. I feel as though I am falling into the frame.', '2005-05-06 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367545, 172694, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric, although I feel that the tree on the right is a little intrusive.</td>', 'Very atmospheric, although I feel that the tree on the right is a little intrusive.', '2005-05-06 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367546, 173344, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very clear at the centre, althoug I find the haziness of the frame to be somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Very clear at the centre, althoug I find the haziness of the frame to be somewhat distracting.', '2005-05-06 15:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367563, 174486, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely proud lioness and a great dilhouette, although I feel that the colour of the sky could be a little more blue.</td>', 'A lovely proud lioness and a great dilhouette, although I feel that the colour of the sky could be a little more blue.', '2005-05-06 15:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367567, 174380, 24212, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see one more finger at least, to give this picture a little more immediate impact. I had to have a good hard look at it to work out what it was.</td>', 'I would prefer to see one more finger at least, to give this picture a little more immediate impact. I had to have a good hard look at it to work out what it was.', '2005-05-06 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367581, 174210, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great idea, though the ribbon doesn''t seem as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'Great idea, though the ribbon doesn''t seem as sharp as it could be.', '2005-05-06 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367582, 173097, 24212, '<td valign="top">I think that the lighting is fantastic.</td>', 'I think that the lighting is fantastic.', '2005-05-06 15:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367585, 174083, 31307, '<td valign="top">Yay Sailboats!</td>', 'Yay Sailboats!', '2005-05-06 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367586, 172457, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wonder whether all the grass in the foreground is really necessary. Nice, sharp shot, though.</td>', 'I wonder whether all the grass in the foreground is really necessary. Nice, sharp shot, though.', '2005-05-06 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367588, 173992, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, dreamy feel and a great revisit of a classic.</td>', 'Wonderful, dreamy feel and a great revisit of a classic.', '2005-05-06 15:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367600, 173992, 33256, '<td valign="top">Here''s to you Mrs Robinson</td>', 'Here''s to you Mrs Robinson', '2005-05-06 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367602, 174535, 33893, '<td valign="top">need to know what you did here! You MUST do a tutorial... please! please!</td>', 'need to know what you did here! You MUST do a tutorial... please! please!', '2005-05-06 16:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367610, 174530, 33893, '<td valign="top">lovely dreamy quality!! How did you get that?</td>', 'lovely dreamy quality!! How did you get that?', '2005-05-06 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367613, 174305, 33893, '<td valign="top">Love this!! I can''t wait to see how you did this!</td>', 'Love this!! I can''t wait to see how you did this!', '2005-05-06 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367628, 172180, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wow, really sharp.</td>', 'Wow, really sharp.', '2005-05-06 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367630, 173393, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but the rock on the left looks as though it could bear a shade more sharpening.</td>', 'I really like this, but the rock on the left looks as though it could bear a shade more sharpening.', '2005-05-06 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367634, 172096, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the swathe of brightness extends from corner to corner diagonally.</td>', 'I like the way that the swathe of brightness extends from corner to corner diagonally.', '2005-05-06 16:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367635, 174320, 34390, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of those Thomas Kincaid prints--very pretty!</td>', 'This reminds me of those Thomas Kincaid prints--very pretty!', '2005-05-06 16:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367637, 172472, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very bleak concept. Very bright colours and wonderful composition.</td>', 'Very bleak concept. Very bright colours and wonderful composition.', '2005-05-06 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367639, 174600, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wish I had tranquil dreams like this. Lovely.</td>', 'I wish I had tranquil dreams like this. Lovely.', '2005-05-06 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367643, 173215, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the ''road'' isn''t distinct enough, although I like the concept.</td>', 'To me, the ''road'' isn''t distinct enough, although I like the concept.', '2005-05-06 16:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367644, 173393, 6532, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversaturated and lacking a point of focus.  Composition doesn''t really do anything for me... sorry.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversaturated and lacking a point of focus.  Composition doesn''t really do anything for me... sorry.', '2005-05-06 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367645, 173500, 24212, '<td valign="top">The motion blur in the ducks is great, although the hand looks overprocessed and jars in comparison with the rest of the image.</td>', 'The motion blur in the ducks is great, although the hand looks overprocessed and jars in comparison with the rest of the image.', '2005-05-06 16:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367646, 173514, 33256, '<td valign="top">LOL Great title. Nice photo too. Dreamlike softness.</td>', 'LOL Great title. Nice photo too. Dreamlike softness.', '2005-05-06 16:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367650, 174695, 34390, '<td valign="top">HAH! Really cute. I love the little tongue sticking out. The dream scene of the tiger could maybe be a little mistier or something, though. I don''t care for the cotton-like stuff around it, and too blue-toned. Adorable cat, though--great shot.</td>', 'HAH! Really cute. I love the little tongue sticking out. The dream scene of the tiger could maybe be a little mistier or something, though. I don''t care for the cotton-like stuff around it, and too blue-toned. Adorable cat, though--great shot.', '2005-05-06 16:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367653, 173176, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice dof and good focus.</td>', 'Nice dof and good focus.', '2005-05-06 16:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367661, 174620, 35293, '<td valign="top">This was taken on Ellis Island right? I took the same pic there a couple years ago... awesome shot</td>', 'This was taken on Ellis Island right? I took the same pic there a couple years ago... awesome shot', '2005-05-06 16:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367664, 174123, 33893, '<td valign="top">Do you dream that you are a card shaped soldier when you are painting these roses? heehee! Careful... you could lose your head!</td>', 'Do you dream that you are a card shaped soldier when you are painting these roses? heehee! Careful... you could lose your head!', '2005-05-06 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367667, 174486, 35293, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot.  The blue looks kind of unnaturally bright, but it provides better contrast for the lion.</td>', 'Powerful shot.  The blue looks kind of unnaturally bright, but it provides better contrast for the lion.', '2005-05-06 16:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367692, 173059, 37422, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective.  Not your typical "field of flowers" shot.</td>', 'Love the perspective.  Not your typical "field of flowers" shot.', '2005-05-06 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367707, 172590, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia and candid look on everyone''s faces..dream of centuries past maybe but with the sunglasses hmm, nice though</td>', 'Nice sepia and candid look on everyone''s faces..dream of centuries past maybe but with the sunglasses hmm, nice though', '2005-05-06 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367710, 173987, 31443, '<td valign="top">Hope your dream comes true, nice image</td>', 'Hope your dream comes true, nice image', '2005-05-06 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367712, 174505, 31443, '<td valign="top">A bit blurred, doesn''t matter since it''s a dream right...</td>', 'A bit blurred, doesn''t matter since it''s a dream right...', '2005-05-06 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367715, 174216, 31443, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment I like this photo more than before, great silhouettes!</td>', 'Coming back to comment I like this photo more than before, great silhouettes!', '2005-05-06 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367729, 174687, 31443, '<td valign="top">The colors of this photo are really pretty, don''t care much for the movement blur, does give a special effect though</td>', 'The colors of this photo are really pretty, don''t care much for the movement blur, does give a special effect though', '2005-05-06 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367732, 172457, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t mind one of those myself :)</td>', 'Wouldn''t mind one of those myself :)', '2005-05-06 17:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367737, 174305, 31443, '<td valign="top">Colorful yes, a bit too busy though</td>', 'Colorful yes, a bit too busy though', '2005-05-06 17:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1367739, 174208, 31443, '<td valign="top">Would love to know how you did this, will come back and see after contest ends...nice image</td>', 'Would love to know how you did this, will come back and see after contest ends...nice image', '2005-05-06 17:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
