(1367844, 174301, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>Ah, I have dreams of this nature! More regarding politics than personal life, but either way this photo really resonates with me. Aside from any statement or challenge, this is hands down a beautiful photograph. Congratulations on making such a lovely photo. <br/> <br/>If I were to offer any advice for improvement (which is really unnecessary and possibly impossible! heh) I would rethink the faded corners (what''s the name of that technique? heh). I think it only adds to this photo as it''s for a Dream challenge. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Ah, I have dreams of this nature! More regarding politics than personal life, but either way this photo really resonates with me. Aside from any statement or challenge, this is hands down a beautiful photograph. Congratulations on making such a lovely photo.  If I were to offer any advice for improvement (which is really unnecessary and possibly impossible! heh) I would rethink the faded corners (what''s the name of that technique? heh). I think it only adds to this photo as it''s for a Dream challenge.  ', '2005-05-06 17:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
