(1368082, 174290, 3032, '<td valign="top">I know that feeling, it is like you live an entirely other live in your dreams, very realistic. Sometimes you wake up feeling more sleepy than when you went in. :(<br/>I think that the concept of this photo has something interesting (the dream stepping out of the physical body) but is most of all hurt by strong compression -&gt; a lot of horizontal and vertical micro banding. Overall it is quite interesting.</td>', 'I know that feeling, it is like you live an entirely other live in your dreams, very realistic. Sometimes you wake up feeling more sleepy than when you went in. :(I think that the concept of this photo has something interesting (the dream stepping out of the physical body) but is most of all hurt by strong compression -> a lot of horizontal and vertical micro banding. Overall it is quite interesting.', '2005-05-06 19:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368088, 174208, 3032, '<td valign="top">The rotating elements and pleasant B&amp;W toning makes this very interesting. It inmediatly gave me a kind of 1920''s feeling. Her waist looks so narrow in this, makes it a bit spooky. Certainly dreamy.</td>', 'The rotating elements and pleasant B&W toning makes this very interesting. It inmediatly gave me a kind of 1920''s feeling. Her waist looks so narrow in this, makes it a bit spooky. Certainly dreamy.', '2005-05-06 19:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
