(1368162, 174691, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is imaginative and I like it a lot.  Don''t know where you were, but if you could have changed into something white and draping to take that image, it would have been an automatic 10.  As it is, the dreamy mode is somewhat chastened by the plaid pants.</td>', 'This is imaginative and I like it a lot.  Don''t know where you were, but if you could have changed into something white and draping to take that image, it would have been an automatic 10.  As it is, the dreamy mode is somewhat chastened by the plaid pants.', '2005-05-06 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
