(1368167, 174216, 14476, '<td valign="top">You found the technique for a magical image.  Love the lighting on the tree and landscape.  With Advanced editing, if you had cloned out that flashlight and the moon, (for me) this would have been an automatic  10.  As it is, a super 7.</td>', 'You found the technique for a magical image.  Love the lighting on the tree and landscape.  With Advanced editing, if you had cloned out that flashlight and the moon, (for me) this would have been an automatic  10.  As it is, a super 7.', '2005-05-06 20:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
