(1368174, 174650, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very, very funny!  I''m still enjoying it at my second look.  (I used to enjoy the nomenclature when I was playing around with racing:  In stock cars  "okay boys, wind ''em up;" in sports car racing, "gentlemen, start your engines") So for old times sake, not to mention the humor, at least a 7.</td>', 'Very, very funny!  I''m still enjoying it at my second look.  (I used to enjoy the nomenclature when I was playing around with racing:  In stock cars  "okay boys, wind ''em up;" in sports car racing, "gentlemen, start your engines") So for old times sake, not to mention the humor, at least a 7.', '2005-05-06 21:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
