(1368235, 174546, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  Too funny!  I can definately relate to this one - haha!  The bottom of the blue ribbon looks faded/off color.  It''s a little distracting.  I also wish there was more contrast in the hands/ribbons... you need some dark darks - it''s too flat.  I still gave it a 8 - great job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  Too funny!  I can definately relate to this one - haha!  The bottom of the blue ribbon looks faded/off color.  It''s a little distracting.  I also wish there was more contrast in the hands/ribbons... you need some dark darks - it''s too flat.  I still gave it a 8 - great job!', '2005-05-06 21:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368246, 174695, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  This photo definately made me laugh! Sooo cute!  I wish that the photo was more in focus (looks a little blurry, if you used a slow shutter speed and hand held it, this may have been why - you may want to use a higher ISO so you can use a faster shutter speed).  I also wish that the photo was a little lighter... or had some more whites/highlights.  The cat has a yellowish tint to her/his white fur.  If it was sharper I would have given it a 9, correct contrast/white then a 10.  However, I did give an 8.  GREAT JOB!!!! I LOVE IT!  Great idea and very creative!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  This photo definately made me laugh! Sooo cute!  I wish that the photo was more in focus (looks a little blurry, if you used a slow shutter speed and hand held it, this may have been why - you may want to use a higher ISO so you can use a faster shutter speed).  I also wish that the photo was a little lighter... or had some more whites/highlights.  The cat has a yellowish tint to her/his white fur.  If it was sharper I would have given it a 9, correct contrast/white then a 10.  However, I did give an 8.  GREAT JOB!!!! I LOVE IT!  Great idea and very creative!', '2005-05-06 21:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368279, 174380, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  I''ve been staring at this photo for a while now and I think it''s a hand.  I like the simplicity and abstractness of this photo, however, I wish that the other fingers were showing so I would have had a better idea of what this photo is about.  If it wasn''t for the title I really would not have had a clue.  Without knowing it''s a hand... this photo''s meaning is lost, which as we know, not many people here look at photos long enough to figure out the meaning.  Otherwise, neat idea for the challenge and I like the colors  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  I''ve been staring at this photo for a while now and I think it''s a hand.  I like the simplicity and abstractness of this photo, however, I wish that the other fingers were showing so I would have had a better idea of what this photo is about.  If it wasn''t for the title I really would not have had a clue.  Without knowing it''s a hand... this photo''s meaning is lost, which as we know, not many people here look at photos long enough to figure out the meaning.  Otherwise, neat idea for the challenge and I like the colors  =)', '2005-05-06 22:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
