(1368402, 173011, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  I live in Florida and I dream of being elsewhere  =)  The right side is too hot... the sky disappeard and the branches are too faded.  Cropping it to portrait from the middle of the trea to the left would have been soooo much better.  The right side really takes so much away from this photo.  I love the angle, texture in the trea, and color of the sky.  If the right side looked like the left or cropped the right side out then I would have given it a 9, as is I gave it a 6.</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  I live in Florida and I dream of being elsewhere  =)  The right side is too hot... the sky disappeard and the branches are too faded.  Cropping it to portrait from the middle of the trea to the left would have been soooo much better.  The right side really takes so much away from this photo.  I love the angle, texture in the trea, and color of the sky.  If the right side looked like the left or cropped the right side out then I would have given it a 9, as is I gave it a 6.', '2005-05-06 23:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368409, 172180, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  Overall I really like it.  I only wish that the top of the building on the right wasn''t clipped and that the buildings did not look like they are leaning- looks like lens distortion.  I also think that maybe leaving a little more not cropped on the right would have made the composition stronger... to balance the left side.  Otherwise, very good job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  Overall I really like it.  I only wish that the top of the building on the right wasn''t clipped and that the buildings did not look like they are leaning- looks like lens distortion.  I also think that maybe leaving a little more not cropped on the right would have made the composition stronger... to balance the left side.  Otherwise, very good job!', '2005-05-06 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368413, 174600, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  Definately a picture that matches it''s title!  I would love to be there!!! Excellent photo!  The reflections in the water is beautiful and what a perfect sky!  Your exposure is better than perfect!  And I love your composition.  I just bumped you from a 7 to 10.  =)  I only wish that random thing in teh water at the river''s bend was cloned out (but that''s a VERY minor detail)  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  Definately a picture that matches it''s title!  I would love to be there!!! Excellent photo!  The reflections in the water is beautiful and what a perfect sky!  Your exposure is better than perfect!  And I love your composition.  I just bumped you from a 7 to 10.  =)  I only wish that random thing in teh water at the river''s bend was cloned out (but that''s a VERY minor detail)  =)', '2005-05-06 23:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368416, 174669, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  What a funny idea!!!  Great job!  I would have liked to have seen a little depth of field... where the background was not in such sharp focus.  I think it would have make your picture a little stronger.  But still, very good job  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  What a funny idea!!!  Great job!  I would have liked to have seen a little depth of field... where the background was not in such sharp focus.  I think it would have make your picture a little stronger.  But still, very good job  =)', '2005-05-06 23:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368424, 172694, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =)  -  I love the overall feel of your photo... has a great, soft look to it.  For some reason, it looks overall a little too "grey" for my taste, but it still looks great... I love the beam''s reflection in the water and it helps break the greyness feel.</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =)  -  I love the overall feel of your photo... has a great, soft look to it.  For some reason, it looks overall a little too "grey" for my taste, but it still looks great... I love the beam''s reflection in the water and it helps break the greyness feel.', '2005-05-06 23:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
