(1369446, 172853, 4411, '<td valign="top">Has a nice dreamlike quality with the mist and streetlights, but the foreground tree is too strong and grabs too much attention.</td>', 'Has a nice dreamlike quality with the mist and streetlights, but the foreground tree is too strong and grabs too much attention.', '2005-05-07 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369458, 174485, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice work "losing" the background - the sofa-floating-in-space effect works well for this theme. Overall a technically good shot which doesn''t particularly grab me though.</td>', 'Nice work "losing" the background - the sofa-floating-in-space effect works well for this theme. Overall a technically good shot which doesn''t particularly grab me though.', '2005-05-07 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369462, 173250, 4411, '<td valign="top">A superb cloud formation - ideal for the challenge. Strange that the clouds seem so muddy in most of the frame though. A good strong curves adjustment would have worked wonders for me here.<br/>Good placement of the subject, though at this size lacking in detail.</td>', 'A superb cloud formation - ideal for the challenge. Strange that the clouds seem so muddy in most of the frame though. A good strong curves adjustment would have worked wonders for me here.Good placement of the subject, though at this size lacking in detail.', '2005-05-07 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369471, 174216, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and very nicely executed. Only 2 things that bother me - the "cables" running across the tree and the red area to the right don''t work well with the rest of the image. The small light in the sky is starting to bug me too now!<br/>The backlight is superb though, and the exposure well controlled. A very strong image.</td>', 'Excellent idea and very nicely executed. Only 2 things that bother me - the "cables" running across the tree and the red area to the right don''t work well with the rest of the image. The small light in the sky is starting to bug me too now!The backlight is superb though, and the exposure well controlled. A very strong image.', '2005-05-07 11:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369479, 174081, 4411, '<td valign="top">I really have no idea what is going on here ... I like that.<br/> <br/>A very good photo indeed. Well exposed, strong focus on the main subjects and plenty of background interest to aid the overall confusion I''m still feeling!</td>', 'I really have no idea what is going on here ... I like that. A very good photo indeed. Well exposed, strong focus on the main subjects and plenty of background interest to aid the overall confusion I''m still feeling!', '2005-05-07 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
