(1369597, 172613, 31443, '<td valign="top">Some are! I can almost smell this flower, Stefanotis right?</td>', 'Some are! I can almost smell this flower, Stefanotis right?', '2005-05-07 13:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369602, 173923, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice image although a little colorless but it''s a dream after all....</td>', 'Nice image although a little colorless but it''s a dream after all....', '2005-05-07 13:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369603, 172150, 4411, '<td valign="top">You have strange dreams for sure - lucky you managed to find an old army camp complete with drummer lying around ; )<br/> <br/>The selective focus and selective desaturation both work really well on this shot to create a nice muted effect. Not a photo that leaps out and grabs me, but well shot and presented anyway.</td>', 'You have strange dreams for sure - lucky you managed to find an old army camp complete with drummer lying around ; ) The selective focus and selective desaturation both work really well on this shot to create a nice muted effect. Not a photo that leaps out and grabs me, but well shot and presented anyway.', '2005-05-07 13:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369604, 174083, 31443, '<td valign="top">Not much contrast but it''s a dream anyway...</td>', 'Not much contrast but it''s a dream anyway...', '2005-05-07 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369605, 173541, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nicely done....even though I think you could have positioned the man in between columns not smack on it...it''s a dream anyway...</td>', 'Nicely done....even though I think you could have positioned the man in between columns not smack on it...it''s a dream anyway...', '2005-05-07 13:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369607, 174446, 31443, '<td valign="top">Glad I got rid of this stinking habit, poor Alan...nice shot!</td>', 'Glad I got rid of this stinking habit, poor Alan...nice shot!', '2005-05-07 13:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369609, 174301, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice overall effect with the b/w, lonely sort of dream I guess</td>', 'Nice overall effect with the b/w, lonely sort of dream I guess', '2005-05-07 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369610, 173644, 31443, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what the dream is about here but a confusing situation often happens in dreams, nice colors...</td>', 'Don''t know what the dream is about here but a confusing situation often happens in dreams, nice colors...', '2005-05-07 13:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369611, 172456, 31443, '<td valign="top">More like a nightmare...</td>', 'More like a nightmare...', '2005-05-07 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369612, 174571, 4411, '<td valign="top">Not for me I''m afraid, but one I''m sure you''ll treasure : )<br/> <br/>Mostly I find this too "random" because of the blankets, though the lighting is a bit too flat too. A crop tighter into the heads may help focus the viewers attention.</td>', 'Not for me I''m afraid, but one I''m sure you''ll treasure : ) Mostly I find this too "random" because of the blankets, though the lighting is a bit too flat too. A crop tighter into the heads may help focus the viewers attention.', '2005-05-07 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369616, 174077, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice camera but this image is not that grand! A bigger photo would perhaps have been better</td>', 'Nice camera but this image is not that grand! A bigger photo would perhaps have been better', '2005-05-07 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369622, 174620, 31443, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''ve seen a photo of this building before, nice subject but this one came out a tad too dark overall....</td>', 'I''m sure I''ve seen a photo of this building before, nice subject but this one came out a tad too dark overall....', '2005-05-07 13:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369625, 172574, 31443, '<td valign="top">Colorful yes but doesn''t indicate any sort of a dream or a subject...</td>', 'Colorful yes but doesn''t indicate any sort of a dream or a subject...', '2005-05-07 13:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369626, 174208, 4411, '<td valign="top">Spooky as heck.<br/> <br/>I love the feeling you''ve created with this. The blur doesn''t give the usual motion effect in that I don''t really feel like anything is spinning. It''s all very "otherworldly" instead. The lines on the dress(?) work really well, as does the B&amp;W treatment.<br/> <br/>A spooky-blurry-dreamy-nightmarish-workofart-10-scoring-masterpiece!</td>', 'Spooky as heck. I love the feeling you''ve created with this. The blur doesn''t give the usual motion effect in that I don''t really feel like anything is spinning. It''s all very "otherworldly" instead. The lines on the dress(?) work really well, as does the B&W treatment. A spooky-blurry-dreamy-nightmarish-workofart-10-scoring-masterpiece!', '2005-05-07 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369631, 174584, 4411, '<td valign="top">A solid attempt at a bug macro. Suffers somewhat from the muddy colours and the fly doesn''t really stand out strongly enough. A difficult subject to tackle - keep trying.</td>', 'A solid attempt at a bug macro. Suffers somewhat from the muddy colours and the fly doesn''t really stand out strongly enough. A difficult subject to tackle - keep trying.', '2005-05-07 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369632, 173514, 31443, '<td valign="top">Funny title and yes, this subject usually wakes me up from a dream. The waterfall is beautiful but way out of focus or blurry you probably meant to have it dreamlike but imo that wasn''t needed....</td>', 'Funny title and yes, this subject usually wakes me up from a dream. The waterfall is beautiful but way out of focus or blurry you probably meant to have it dreamlike but imo that wasn''t needed....', '2005-05-07 13:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369635, 174584, 31443, '<td valign="top">Don''t really know what the title indicates but the overall image lacks a bit of the dreamy theme....</td>', 'Don''t really know what the title indicates but the overall image lacks a bit of the dreamy theme....', '2005-05-07 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369642, 174210, 31443, '<td valign="top">The hands should have been more visible imo...</td>', 'The hands should have been more visible imo...', '2005-05-07 13:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369644, 172540, 4411, '<td valign="top">A fairly nice capture of some pretty flowers. Seems to be caught in the middle somewhere as far as sharpness goes - it''s not sharp and contrasty enough to show off the details, but it''s not soft enough to create a soft and dreamy effect which may have worked well for this challenge.<br/>The bright light in the trees in the background is a bit harsh too.<br/> <br/>Your composition shows you''ve got the right idea for this kind of shot - keep working on them and enjoy : )</td>', 'A fairly nice capture of some pretty flowers. Seems to be caught in the middle somewhere as far as sharpness goes - it''s not sharp and contrasty enough to show off the details, but it''s not soft enough to create a soft and dreamy effect which may have worked well for this challenge.The bright light in the trees in the background is a bit harsh too. Your composition shows you''ve got the right idea for this kind of shot - keep working on them and enjoy : )', '2005-05-07 13:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369645, 173619, 31443, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much in this image, maybe a pair of jeans hanging on a line?</td>', 'I don''t see much in this image, maybe a pair of jeans hanging on a line?', '2005-05-07 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369648, 173379, 31443, '<td valign="top">Pity about overexposing this image and desaturating it as well makes the eyes really stand out way too much....</td>', 'Pity about overexposing this image and desaturating it as well makes the eyes really stand out way too much....', '2005-05-07 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369682, 174528, 4411, '<td valign="top">... but opening up on just one side can lead to an imbalance.<br/> <br/>I like this - apart from the petal which is lying flat. The lighting on this one petal is too strong giving it some very hot areas, and a different colour cast.<br/> <br/>The rest of the flower is beautifully photographed though. The stamen are nice and sharp, and the tips of the petals are nicely *just* out of focus, giving them a nice soft appearance.</td>', '... but opening up on just one side can lead to an imbalance. I like this - apart from the petal which is lying flat. The lighting on this one petal is too strong giving it some very hot areas, and a different colour cast. The rest of the flower is beautifully photographed though. The stamen are nice and sharp, and the tips of the petals are nicely *just* out of focus, giving them a nice soft appearance.', '2005-05-07 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369716, 174581, 4411, '<td valign="top">Good grief! It''s an alien from the new Doctor Who series?! ; )<br/> <br/>Composition is strong, but the near side of the face is a little too dark. Nice sharpness and detail on the feathers though.<br/> <br/>A tough subject to photograph, and not one which is going to appeal to many voters (me incuded I''m afraid), but a well taken shot.</td>', 'Good grief! It''s an alien from the new Doctor Who series?! ; ) Composition is strong, but the near side of the face is a little too dark. Nice sharpness and detail on the feathers though. A tough subject to photograph, and not one which is going to appeal to many voters (me incuded I''m afraid), but a well taken shot.', '2005-05-07 14:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369718, 174364, 31443, '<td valign="top">A nightmare by the looks of it, imaginative</td>', 'A nightmare by the looks of it, imaginative', '2005-05-07 14:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369727, 174224, 4411, '<td valign="top">A nice flower shot. Needs a little more "pop" in the colours and the whites to make it stand out, and the background elements (another flower head?) are a bit distracting. A very tight macro of the coloured area would work *really* well with this flower I''m sure.<br/> <br/>Focus is good, and composition isn''t too bad though. Keep shooting beauts like these and have fun!</td>', 'A nice flower shot. Needs a little more "pop" in the colours and the whites to make it stand out, and the background elements (another flower head?) are a bit distracting. A very tight macro of the coloured area would work *really* well with this flower I''m sure. Focus is good, and composition isn''t too bad though. Keep shooting beauts like these and have fun!', '2005-05-07 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369802, 174363, 30959, '<td valign="top">To me, the smudginess of the image detracts from what is most compelling in the action. For my tastes, a cleaner background minus what appears as smudges would have made a stronger image.</td>', 'To me, the smudginess of the image detracts from what is most compelling in the action. For my tastes, a cleaner background minus what appears as smudges would have made a stronger image.', '2005-05-07 15:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369803, 172574, 30959, '<td valign="top">Bumping up on technical merit and overall pleasing colors. Not sure it fits as a dram.</td>', 'Bumping up on technical merit and overall pleasing colors. Not sure it fits as a dram.', '2005-05-07 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369811, 173619, 30959, '<td valign="top">The images is diffucult to make out and thus will likely score a bit lower as it takes time to put this together and make sense of it. Now that I have done so, I am bumping up.</td>', 'The images is diffucult to make out and thus will likely score a bit lower as it takes time to put this together and make sense of it. Now that I have done so, I am bumping up.', '2005-05-07 15:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369878, 174576, 30959, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and wave action in this, however it is fairly soft focus wise. Sharper focus would have made this appeal more to me.</td>', 'I like the colors and wave action in this, however it is fairly soft focus wise. Sharper focus would have made this appeal more to me.', '2005-05-07 16:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369884, 173379, 4411, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt at high key. I''m not particularly keen on the purple used for the eyes, it seems too strong and too unnatural. There''s also a few too many distractions creeping into the shot such as the collar, and the background next to the eye on the left. Focus is very good and the composition isn''t bad though.</td>', 'A nice attempt at high key. I''m not particularly keen on the purple used for the eyes, it seems too strong and too unnatural. There''s also a few too many distractions creeping into the shot such as the collar, and the background next to the eye on the left. Focus is very good and the composition isn''t bad though.', '2005-05-07 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369891, 172150, 30959, '<td valign="top">Second pass, I likethis more now that I can spend time contemplating the setting ,  has a nice dreamlike quality to it.</td>', 'Second pass, I likethis more now that I can spend time contemplating the setting ,  has a nice dreamlike quality to it.', '2005-05-07 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369893, 174620, 4411, '<td valign="top">First thought - seems tilted.<br/>That out of the way I quite like the shot. The variations in patterns and distortions are great while the image as a whole gives a sort of "through the keyhole" impression despite it''s obvious scale. The black &amp; white treatment works well too.</td>', 'First thought - seems tilted.That out of the way I quite like the shot. The variations in patterns and distortions are great while the image as a whole gives a sort of "through the keyhole" impression despite it''s obvious scale. The black & white treatment works well too.', '2005-05-07 16:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369904, 173215, 4411, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is wierd!<br/>I like how this makes me think about what I''m seeing, though I feel I''m never going to figure it out. Photographically, the image is very soft with too many blown highlights, but it still leaves a positive impression.</td>', 'Okay, this is wierd!I like how this makes me think about what I''m seeing, though I feel I''m never going to figure it out. Photographically, the image is very soft with too many blown highlights, but it still leaves a positive impression.', '2005-05-07 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369916, 174367, 4411, '<td valign="top">A good sharp shot. Not entirely sure about the composition - including half of the body, but no legs - maybe a portrait crop would suit this better? The highlight of the shot is the face, the expression is superb.</td>', 'A good sharp shot. Not entirely sure about the composition - including half of the body, but no legs - maybe a portrait crop would suit this better? The highlight of the shot is the face, the expression is superb.', '2005-05-07 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
