(1370592, 174546, 34247, '<td valign="top">the saturated blue draws the attention to it, and not at the more interesting process of reaching out for the blue. there''s a lack of contrast here that imho could and should be fixed. it''s a nice idea, but the executed image isn''t very effective for me.</td>', 'the saturated blue draws the attention to it, and not at the more interesting process of reaching out for the blue. there''s a lack of contrast here that imho could and should be fixed. it''s a nice idea, but the executed image isn''t very effective for me.', '2005-05-08 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370595, 174669, 34247, '<td valign="top">i want to like this picture, but the background shiny, metallic materials are just too busy. the chocolates are colorful, shiny, etc, and their impact is toned down, imho, by the bright background. Perhaps the use of something simples, monotonal, darker would have brought out more of the primary subject and cast a more dramatic effevt.</td>', 'i want to like this picture, but the background shiny, metallic materials are just too busy. the chocolates are colorful, shiny, etc, and their impact is toned down, imho, by the bright background. Perhaps the use of something simples, monotonal, darker would have brought out more of the primary subject and cast a more dramatic effevt.', '2005-05-08 01:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370628, 174459, 35169, '<td valign="top">I personally feel that this image is oversharpened and oversaturated with color.  There is a halo effect present at the peaks of the mountains and the steam looks gritty.  Some people really like this effect, some don''t_I don''t.  The presentation is neatly laid out and has an interesting concept.</td>', 'I personally feel that this image is oversharpened and oversaturated with color.  There is a halo effect present at the peaks of the mountains and the steam looks gritty.  Some people really like this effect, some don''t_I don''t.  The presentation is neatly laid out and has an interesting concept.', '2005-05-08 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370639, 174687, 35169, '<td valign="top">This is impossible to look at.  I''ll bet you aren''t getting comments ''cause of it.  I can relate to this dream too.  Composition is good (I think), natural colors are a good choice, focus is dead on.  Good job.</td>', 'This is impossible to look at.  I''ll bet you aren''t getting comments ''cause of it.  I can relate to this dream too.  Composition is good (I think), natural colors are a good choice, focus is dead on.  Good job.', '2005-05-08 01:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370660, 174484, 35169, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this...   If I had to find something wrong I would say the top is cropped a little close to the border, but this is an interesting presentation, well composed. Color treatment gets Kuddos!</td>', 'I can relate to this...   If I had to find something wrong I would say the top is cropped a little close to the border, but this is an interesting presentation, well composed. Color treatment gets Kuddos!', '2005-05-08 01:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370674, 172540, 35169, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture... Eventhough I like the crystaline impression, I object to the lose of detail. The focus is excellant, so I think that a little less sharpening would have reduced the halo and still given you a sharp image.  Gorgeous light</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture... Eventhough I like the crystaline impression, I object to the lose of detail. The focus is excellant, so I think that a little less sharpening would have reduced the halo and still given you a sharp image.  Gorgeous light', '2005-05-08 01:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370681, 173097, 35169, '<td valign="top">I still have nightmares from seeing "Psyco" when I was a kid, I''ll probably dream about this guy tonight. Great composition and treatment.  I could do without the border entirely, I think the image stands on its own.  What''d ya do to the models nose?</td>', 'I still have nightmares from seeing "Psyco" when I was a kid, I''ll probably dream about this guy tonight. Great composition and treatment.  I could do without the border entirely, I think the image stands on its own.  What''d ya do to the models nose?', '2005-05-08 01:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370693, 174620, 35169, '<td valign="top">I feel like I am leaning.... subject is quite good choice for "B&amp;W"  Good crisp image.  As far as composition, a closer crop at the top might look good and help draw eyes into the gridwork and floor.</td>', 'I feel like I am leaning.... subject is quite good choice for "B&W"  Good crisp image.  As far as composition, a closer crop at the top might look good and help draw eyes into the gridwork and floor.', '2005-05-08 01:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370779, 174248, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool concept but seems overly staged in this composition with the curvy swords and blueish lighting.</td>', 'Cool concept but seems overly staged in this composition with the curvy swords and blueish lighting.', '2005-05-08 03:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370782, 173619, 20168, '<td valign="top">Too indistinct for my eyes.  The concept of falling is a good one for dreams, captivating our fears of falling, but this photo lacks clarity of focus and design to support the fears.</td>', 'Too indistinct for my eyes.  The concept of falling is a good one for dreams, captivating our fears of falling, but this photo lacks clarity of focus and design to support the fears.', '2005-05-08 03:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370784, 172135, 20168, '<td valign="top">Fine greyscale, but not much of fear here and not very "dream like".</td>', 'Fine greyscale, but not much of fear here and not very "dream like".', '2005-05-08 03:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370786, 174415, 20168, '<td valign="top">Indistinct vision of flight, dove, peace.  Negative seems to hinder this photo rather than enhance.  Lovely use of negative space though.</td>', 'Indistinct vision of flight, dove, peace.  Negative seems to hinder this photo rather than enhance.  Lovely use of negative space though.', '2005-05-08 03:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370787, 173923, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, and dreamlike lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, and dreamlike lighting.', '2005-05-08 03:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370788, 174380, 20168, '<td valign="top">Uncertain subject, and lighting is non-dreamlike.</td>', 'Uncertain subject, and lighting is non-dreamlike.', '2005-05-08 03:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370791, 172590, 20168, '<td valign="top">Seems more like staged historical caricature than actual "dream".  But beautiful use of sepia quality for historic erea photo.</td>', 'Seems more like staged historical caricature than actual "dream".  But beautiful use of sepia quality for historic erea photo.', '2005-05-08 03:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370800, 174687, 29269, '<td valign="top">Another one that is amazing - it looks alive, it keeps coming at me. Not as effective as the other one but very good indeed. 8.</td>', 'Another one that is amazing - it looks alive, it keeps coming at me. Not as effective as the other one but very good indeed. 8.', '2005-05-08 03:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370889, 174600, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice contrast and nice framing</td>', 'nice contrast and nice framing', '2005-05-08 07:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370891, 174609, 16266, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract image.  It is a bit too grainy for my likes, or , oand the saturation is a bit blown out, i realize you were going to bizzare abstract, but i still like seeing all the colors.</td>', 'interesting abstract image.  It is a bit too grainy for my likes, or , oand the saturation is a bit blown out, i realize you were going to bizzare abstract, but i still like seeing all the colors.', '2005-05-08 07:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370892, 174308, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice idea, and good concept.  I am missing the blacks.</td>', 'nice idea, and good concept.  I am missing the blacks.', '2005-05-08 07:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370893, 173989, 16266, '<td valign="top">very dreamlike, i like the contrast and exposure.  great job.</td>', 'very dreamlike, i like the contrast and exposure.  great job.', '2005-05-08 07:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370894, 174446, 16266, '<td valign="top">well interesting image</td>', 'well interesting image', '2005-05-08 07:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370896, 173097, 16266, '<td valign="top">very dream like.  A bit over saturated on the face, or too high contrast.  Nice moody lighting</td>', 'very dream like.  A bit over saturated on the face, or too high contrast.  Nice moody lighting', '2005-05-08 07:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370897, 174620, 16266, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and great idea.</td>', 'very nice lighting and great idea.', '2005-05-08 07:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370898, 173276, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice image, good idea.</td>', 'nice image, good idea.', '2005-05-08 07:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370899, 174380, 16266, '<td valign="top">well i have a feeling this isn''t going to get a very good mark, but i like it a lot.  It is abstract, yet I can figure out what it is.  It has a good dream feeling.  I like the very yellowness of the light, but that it isn''t over powering.  Good ''espression'' on the hand.  High marks from me.</td>', 'well i have a feeling this isn''t going to get a very good mark, but i like it a lot.  It is abstract, yet I can figure out what it is.  It has a good dream feeling.  I like the very yellowness of the light, but that it isn''t over powering.  Good ''espression'' on the hand.  High marks from me.', '2005-05-08 07:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370900, 174320, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice dodging in the middle (if that is what you did) very dream like</td>', 'nice dodging in the middle (if that is what you did) very dream like', '2005-05-08 07:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370901, 174083, 16266, '<td valign="top">great image.  looks VERY ols... nice job.</td>', 'great image.  looks VERY ols... nice job.', '2005-05-08 08:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370902, 173059, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice image.  I really like the use of the fish eye here.  Nice espression and light.</td>', 'nice image.  I really like the use of the fish eye here.  Nice espression and light.', '2005-05-08 08:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370904, 174697, 16266, '<td valign="top">great image.  impressive lighting, great dark background against the white flowers.</td>', 'great image.  impressive lighting, great dark background against the white flowers.', '2005-05-08 08:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370906, 174301, 16266, '<td valign="top">i am not sure i am a fan of the fading grey WITH the black border.  They seem to contradict eachother.  I think i would like it with one or the other but not both.  otherwise nice image with good blacks and whites.</td>', 'i am not sure i am a fan of the fading grey WITH the black border.  They seem to contradict eachother.  I think i would like it with one or the other but not both.  otherwise nice image with good blacks and whites.', '2005-05-08 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370908, 174484, 16266, '<td valign="top">great bizaree abstract image.  I wish there was better blacks tho, perhaps you were trying to to make it more dreamlike, but i still miss the full range of grey''s</td>', 'great bizaree abstract image.  I wish there was better blacks tho, perhaps you were trying to to make it more dreamlike, but i still miss the full range of grey''s', '2005-05-08 08:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370909, 174020, 16266, '<td valign="top">i have always wanted to photograph manequens.. they are sort of surreal and bizarre... nice image.  good idea.</td>', 'i have always wanted to photograph manequens.. they are sort of surreal and bizarre... nice image.  good idea.', '2005-05-08 08:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370923, 174380, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.<br/>Hard to tell what''s going on straight away (no bad thing) and the thumbnail looks like those bl**dy rocks in Oregon! The tilted, out of focus lamp works really well. I even like the funky red fringing. There''s maybe a little too much dark space at the bottom of the image, but otherwise this is a well composed, suitably dreamlike abstract. Good stuff.</td>', 'Nice idea.Hard to tell what''s going on straight away (no bad thing) and the thumbnail looks like those bl**dy rocks in Oregon! The tilted, out of focus lamp works really well. I even like the funky red fringing. There''s maybe a little too much dark space at the bottom of the image, but otherwise this is a well composed, suitably dreamlike abstract. Good stuff.', '2005-05-08 08:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370927, 174290, 4411, '<td valign="top">Wierd as heck, and definitely dreamlike.<br/>This looks very much like a screen-grab from a TV for some reason. I like the strangeness of this, but it needs a stronger focal point. I want to see more of the higher of the two central faces, but there''s a lack of detail there, and the two light areas just above are very strong. <br/>Overall, an intruiging image that I do like - I hope to see more experimenting with stuff like this.</td>', 'Wierd as heck, and definitely dreamlike.This looks very much like a screen-grab from a TV for some reason. I like the strangeness of this, but it needs a stronger focal point. I want to see more of the higher of the two central faces, but there''s a lack of detail there, and the two light areas just above are very strong. Overall, an intruiging image that I do like - I hope to see more experimenting with stuff like this.', '2005-05-08 08:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370930, 173541, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this is the first "ghost" I''ve come across.<br/>A good location for this type of shot, but not the greatest execution. The first thing that I see is the "ghost" with a big post sticking out of its head! I don''t know what else is in the area, just out of frame, but it would be worthwhile trying to keep the bright white wall out of frame - as well as hurting the "spookiness" it can''t be making the exposure any easier. From what I can see I would have concentrated on the area with the wheels and the dark wall behind as a backdrop.<br/>Nice effort, just needs some work.</td>', 'I''m surprised this is the first "ghost" I''ve come across.A good location for this type of shot, but not the greatest execution. The first thing that I see is the "ghost" with a big post sticking out of its head! I don''t know what else is in the area, just out of frame, but it would be worthwhile trying to keep the bright white wall out of frame - as well as hurting the "spookiness" it can''t be making the exposure any easier. From what I can see I would have concentrated on the area with the wheels and the dark wall behind as a backdrop.Nice effort, just needs some work.', '2005-05-08 08:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370932, 172844, 4411, '<td valign="top">First thought ... it''s tilted.<br/>Seems like a well focused, well exposed image, but the colour treatment is very harsh. Obviously done to create a dreamlike impression, but a bit too "fake" for my tastes. I can''t help thinking that a simple black &amp; white or sepia treatment would have worked much better.<br/>Hope somebody managed to save her at the last second : )</td>', 'First thought ... it''s tilted.Seems like a well focused, well exposed image, but the colour treatment is very harsh. Obviously done to create a dreamlike impression, but a bit too "fake" for my tastes. I can''t help thinking that a simple black & white or sepia treatment would have worked much better.Hope somebody managed to save her at the last second : )', '2005-05-08 08:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370935, 172472, 4411, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the title ... so I''ll just ignore it : )<br/>Technically very well executed, and quite an interesting shot. The colour variation in the sand that''s been thrown up is intuiging in itself. I''m seeing a strange squiggle in the sky behind the man though, and a speck of sensor dust which should be cloned out.<br/>Overall, a "where on earth did this idea come from?" shot (a good thing) with good strong shapes and colours.</td>', 'Don''t like the title ... so I''ll just ignore it : )Technically very well executed, and quite an interesting shot. The colour variation in the sand that''s been thrown up is intuiging in itself. I''m seeing a strange squiggle in the sky behind the man though, and a speck of sensor dust which should be cloned out.Overall, a "where on earth did this idea come from?" shot (a good thing) with good strong shapes and colours.', '2005-05-08 08:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370948, 174391, 33652, '<td valign="top">Cool. Like a modern day version of Van Goghs room!</td>', 'Cool. Like a modern day version of Van Goghs room!', '2005-05-08 09:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370953, 173541, 33652, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Would be cool to get some instruments, and do poses like the Monkeys ("Take the last train to Clarksville"!).<br/></td>', 'Interesting photo. Would be cool to get some instruments, and do poses like the Monkeys ("Take the last train to Clarksville"!).', '2005-05-08 09:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370956, 174446, 33652, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. The low angle light giving the big shadow works well</td>', 'Clever idea. The low angle light giving the big shadow works well', '2005-05-08 09:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370958, 174583, 33652, '<td valign="top">balance softness (dreamlike quality) and image quality well achieved!</td>', 'balance softness (dreamlike quality) and image quality well achieved!', '2005-05-08 09:25:49.000000', NULL, 1);
