(1371241, 172590, 35169, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  Presentation is excellant, good job on the sepia.  Great detail.</td>', 'This is very cool.  Presentation is excellant, good job on the sepia.  Great detail.', '2005-05-08 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371245, 174020, 35169, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic presentation.</td>', 'Very dramatic presentation.', '2005-05-08 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371248, 172613, 35169, '<td valign="top">Up close and personal with a Hoya blossom... not something I''ve dreamed about tlately.  very good sharp image, nicely processed.  color is excellant.</td>', 'Up close and personal with a Hoya blossom... not something I''ve dreamed about tlately.  very good sharp image, nicely processed.  color is excellant.', '2005-05-08 14:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371252, 174301, 35169, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this image, except the feathering.  The clouds and tree are beautiful and dramatic and the landscape, at this size maybe a little dark... it works well though except the feathering.  Even the frame is a plus.</td>', 'I enjoy this image, except the feathering.  The clouds and tree are beautiful and dramatic and the landscape, at this size maybe a little dark... it works well though except the feathering.  Even the frame is a plus.', '2005-05-08 14:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371260, 174505, 35169, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, serene iamge.  could be a little sharper, since my eyes want to go to the "walker", I would suggest a focus point on him.  The focus is in the foreground which defies the eye.</td>', 'Very pretty, serene iamge.  could be a little sharper, since my eyes want to go to the "walker", I would suggest a focus point on him.  The focus is in the foreground which defies the eye.', '2005-05-08 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371284, 174576, 35169, '<td valign="top">A bit blown out at the top, but a pretty image,</td>', 'A bit blown out at the top, but a pretty image,', '2005-05-08 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371289, 174528, 35169, '<td valign="top">The border adds nothing to the image (IMO) it actually detracts from the overall impact.  nice focus, good detail, sutle colors.  Like the concept.. many of us need to open up a bit more.</td>', 'The border adds nothing to the image (IMO) it actually detracts from the overall impact.  nice focus, good detail, sutle colors.  Like the concept.. many of us need to open up a bit more.', '2005-05-08 15:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371396, 173989, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of movement here. the model''s pose and clothing works well with the dream theme, and the imperfect shadow/lighting work is impressive to my eyes. 10</td>', 'I like the sense of movement here. the model''s pose and clothing works well with the dream theme, and the imperfect shadow/lighting work is impressive to my eyes. 10', '2005-05-08 16:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371432, 172613, 36982, '<td valign="top">Your dream comes true with me :)</td>', 'Your dream comes true with me :)', '2005-05-08 16:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371786, 174430, 4411, '<td valign="top">A decent portrait. Lighting is very nice, though maybe a *little* too dark on the near side of the face. Composition is mostly good apart from the bright area in the top corner which is a distraction.<br/>I do like the candid look and the relaxed/open mouth. Good stuff.</td>', 'A decent portrait. Lighting is very nice, though maybe a *little* too dark on the near side of the face. Composition is mostly good apart from the bright area in the top corner which is a distraction.I do like the candid look and the relaxed/open mouth. Good stuff.', '2005-05-08 20:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371794, 172613, 4411, '<td valign="top">I know from experience how difficult it is to find a nice arrangement and isolate these types of very small flowers, so well done on that score. These are beautiful. The good use of tight DoF and a great composition make the shot. Top stuff.</td>', 'I know from experience how difficult it is to find a nice arrangement and isolate these types of very small flowers, so well done on that score. These are beautiful. The good use of tight DoF and a great composition make the shot. Top stuff.', '2005-05-08 21:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371825, 174546, 30576, '<td valign="top">this is a winner!!</td>', 'this is a winner!!', '2005-05-08 21:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371884, 174581, 26741, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity, nice color.  Yeesh...turkeys are UGLY!</td>', 'Beautiful clarity, nice color.  Yeesh...turkeys are UGLY!', '2005-05-08 22:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371886, 172694, 26741, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus.  Beautiful sunset.  This makes me think of Hogwarts school from Harry Potter!</td>', 'I like the soft focus.  Beautiful sunset.  This makes me think of Hogwarts school from Harry Potter!', '2005-05-08 22:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371893, 173176, 26741, '<td valign="top">I wish the DOF was more on the middle of the thong, rather than the closest seam, but maybe that''s what you were shooting for.  Not my side of the plate, but I''m sure the guys are loving it!</td>', 'I wish the DOF was more on the middle of the thong, rather than the closest seam, but maybe that''s what you were shooting for.  Not my side of the plate, but I''m sure the guys are loving it!', '2005-05-08 22:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371899, 174066, 26741, '<td valign="top">My eye was drawn to the branches on the upper left corner and the tree on the right.  It feels as though there''s no central subject. Lovely color on a lovely clear day!</td>', 'My eye was drawn to the branches on the upper left corner and the tree on the right.  It feels as though there''s no central subject. Lovely color on a lovely clear day!', '2005-05-08 22:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371902, 174546, 26741, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I like how the hands are slightly "washed-out,"  giving it a dream-like quality!</td>', 'Great concept.  I like how the hands are slightly "washed-out,"  giving it a dream-like quality!', '2005-05-08 22:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371905, 173215, 26741, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get this.  Maybe too much post-process?</td>', 'I don''t quite get this.  Maybe too much post-process?', '2005-05-08 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371908, 174687, 26741, '<td valign="top">Whoa...totally gives the sensation of motion!  I checked my beverage for funny additives!  Almost a little too distracting, felt like I needed a dramamine!</td>', 'Whoa...totally gives the sensation of motion!  I checked my beverage for funny additives!  Almost a little too distracting, felt like I needed a dramamine!', '2005-05-08 22:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
