(1373567, 172868, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lines in the window and door all look a little weird. I assume it''s due to a filter having been applied.The ''pencils'' look unaffected and the overall effect is a bit strange. Perhaps if the filter (if indeed it was) were to have been applied a bit more strongly, it wouldn''t look so strange.</td>', 'The lines in the window and door all look a little weird. I assume it''s due to a filter having been applied.The ''pencils'' look unaffected and the overall effect is a bit strange. Perhaps if the filter (if indeed it was) were to have been applied a bit more strongly, it wouldn''t look so strange.', '2005-05-09 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373572, 174581, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m having nightmares just looking at the turkey. Nicely sharp, although the feathers on the left look a little bright on my monitor-very difficult to get exactlyright, though in my limited experience.</td>', 'I''m having nightmares just looking at the turkey. Nicely sharp, although the feathers on the left look a little bright on my monitor-very difficult to get exactlyright, though in my limited experience.', '2005-05-09 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373574, 174571, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here. This photo would work almost any way up.</td>', 'I like the composition here. This photo would work almost any way up.', '2005-05-09 15:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373577, 172135, 24212, '<td valign="top">I must say that I don''t really get a sensation of fear, but I can really see the interest shown by the two people on the left. I feel that the lady on the right is a little superfluous.</td>', 'I must say that I don''t really get a sensation of fear, but I can really see the interest shown by the two people on the left. I feel that the lady on the right is a little superfluous.', '2005-05-09 15:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373579, 173989, 24212, '<td valign="top">Well, I think you have more cultured dreams than I do. I like the lighting here.</td>', 'Well, I think you have more cultured dreams than I do. I like the lighting here.', '2005-05-09 15:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373620, 173059, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the fisheye effect. Great expression captured here.</td>', 'I love the fisheye effect. Great expression captured here.', '2005-05-09 16:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373623, 174664, 24212, '<td valign="top">I don''t know much about baseball, being a Brit and all that, but it looks to me as though the focus in this shot is on the grass at the rear of the frame. I think that perhaps I''d prefer to see the legs in sharper focus.</td>', 'I don''t know much about baseball, being a Brit and all that, but it looks to me as though the focus in this shot is on the grass at the rear of the frame. I think that perhaps I''d prefer to see the legs in sharper focus.', '2005-05-09 16:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373628, 174123, 24212, '<td valign="top">Really sharp and an extremely attractive still-life. If anything, though, the petals at the top and on the right of the yellow rose look a little too bright, on my screen at least.</td>', 'Really sharp and an extremely attractive still-life. If anything, though, the petals at the top and on the right of the yellow rose look a little too bright, on my screen at least.', '2005-05-09 16:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373629, 173097, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The composition and lighting set the mood perfectly.  However I think too much noise reduction was applied.  The person and his clothing have a very plastic look. 6</td>', 'Good idea.  The composition and lighting set the mood perfectly.  However I think too much noise reduction was applied.  The person and his clothing have a very plastic look. 6', '2005-05-09 16:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373630, 174688, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the blur effect and the way that the stamens are sharp.</td>', 'I really like the blur effect and the way that the stamens are sharp.', '2005-05-09 16:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373633, 173338, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field and great sharpness. Almost missed the youngster at the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Great depth of field and great sharpness. Almost missed the youngster at the edge of the frame.', '2005-05-09 16:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373634, 173276, 24212, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp. Great sky.</td>', 'Nicely sharp. Great sky.', '2005-05-09 16:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373640, 174301, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the clarity. I understand that the haziness around the corners is to give it a dream-like quality, but I feel that it may be a little overdone.</td>', 'I like the composition and the clarity. I understand that the haziness around the corners is to give it a dream-like quality, but I feel that it may be a little overdone.', '2005-05-09 16:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373646, 172613, 24212, '<td valign="top">The very narrow DOF appears to have led to the second ''flower'' from the right at the top to be slightly soft-focussed, whilst the two flanking it are sharp. I''d perhaps rather see all three sharp.</td>', 'The very narrow DOF appears to have led to the second ''flower'' from the right at the top to be slightly soft-focussed, whilst the two flanking it are sharp. I''d perhaps rather see all three sharp.', '2005-05-09 16:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373652, 174697, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the colours in this shot, but I feel that the upper bloom looks a little too soft and perhaps a bit lost against the bright spots in the background. I feel also that the stamens appearing in the top right intrude a bit too much.</td>', 'I like the colours in this shot, but I feel that the upper bloom looks a little too soft and perhaps a bit lost against the bright spots in the background. I feel also that the stamens appearing in the top right intrude a bit too much.', '2005-05-09 16:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373658, 174077, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can feel the lens envy coming on...<br/> <br/>I think that getting the lens cap level is a really neat touch that many others, myself included, might have overlooked.</td>', 'I can feel the lens envy coming on... I think that getting the lens cap level is a really neat touch that many others, myself included, might have overlooked.', '2005-05-09 16:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373659, 173353, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''m quite intrigued as to what the item at the centre of the frame might be, as I feel that it rather dominates.</td>', 'I''m quite intrigued as to what the item at the centre of the frame might be, as I feel that it rather dominates.', '2005-05-09 16:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373665, 174505, 24212, '<td valign="top">While the colours are quite striking, I feel that they may be a little too saturated. (Granted, it''s a challenge about dreams)</td>', 'While the colours are quite striking, I feel that they may be a little too saturated. (Granted, it''s a challenge about dreams)', '2005-05-09 16:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373671, 174535, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done. I just feel that a little more sharpness would help.</td>', 'Very cleverly done. I just feel that a little more sharpness would help.', '2005-05-09 16:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373672, 174313, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. Sharp where it needs to be. A real mood of pensiveness.</td>', 'Great DOF. Sharp where it needs to be. A real mood of pensiveness.', '2005-05-09 16:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373674, 174546, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and I think it''s well executed. Perhaps if anything, the hands and arms could be a little darker.</td>', 'I like the concept and I think it''s well executed. Perhaps if anything, the hands and arms could be a little darker.', '2005-05-09 16:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373675, 172944, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this, but feel that it would benefit from greater depth of field. It seems that the yacht is not quite as sharp as it could be.</td>', 'I like the composition of this, but feel that it would benefit from greater depth of field. It seems that the yacht is not quite as sharp as it could be.', '2005-05-09 16:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373679, 174484, 24212, '<td valign="top">A really strange dream indeed. I like the treatment, it gives it a feeling almost like a publicity shot for a psychological horror film.</td>', 'A really strange dream indeed. I like the treatment, it gives it a feeling almost like a publicity shot for a psychological horror film.', '2005-05-09 16:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373684, 174528, 24212, '<td valign="top">While the petal on the left looks sharp enough, the petals on the right look a bit soft. I''d perhaps like to see it sharp all over.</td>', 'While the petal on the left looks sharp enough, the petals on the right look a bit soft. I''d perhaps like to see it sharp all over.', '2005-05-09 16:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373709, 174290, 24212, '<td valign="top">Quite scary.</td>', 'Quite scary.', '2005-05-09 16:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373710, 174391, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very curious. I love the cat''s expression on the vase.</td>', 'Very curious. I love the cat''s expression on the vase.', '2005-05-09 16:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373714, 172844, 24212, '<td valign="top">The colour treatment is perhaps a little overpowering, as I didn''t see the figure on the tracks at first. There are a few patches around the engine which are white and seem out of place here.</td>', 'The colour treatment is perhaps a little overpowering, as I didn''t see the figure on the tracks at first. There are a few patches around the engine which are white and seem out of place here.', '2005-05-09 16:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373716, 174305, 24212, '<td valign="top">I find this a very uplifting image. Lovely colours.</td>', 'I find this a very uplifting image. Lovely colours.', '2005-05-09 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373722, 173923, 24212, '<td valign="top">I can almost sense the intake of breath, ready to blow the seeds off the dandelion.</td>', 'I can almost sense the intake of breath, ready to blow the seeds off the dandelion.', '2005-05-09 16:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373724, 174502, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft-focus effect around the couple.</td>', 'I really like the soft-focus effect around the couple.', '2005-05-09 16:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
