(1373790, 174320, 35169, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the black edge on the frame, but I think this a beautiful image.  I think it should win.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the black edge on the frame, but I think this a beautiful image.  I think it should win.', '2005-05-09 17:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373795, 174505, 22479, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic location to shoot a picture. This is certainly dreamy in appearance and perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'What a fantastic location to shoot a picture. This is certainly dreamy in appearance and perfect for this challenge.', '2005-05-09 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373800, 173338, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like this! This is a bit dark and brooding, not what one would expect to see for a ''childhood memories'' shot. This study in contrast is precisely why I like it. Bumping up.</td>', 'I like this! This is a bit dark and brooding, not what one would expect to see for a ''childhood memories'' shot. This study in contrast is precisely why I like it. Bumping up.', '2005-05-09 17:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373803, 174216, 22479, '<td valign="top">The flashlight doesn''t work for me. However....the rest of the image is just perfect. Especially how the tree is just a bit off kilter. <br/> <br/>A suggestion which may also work well is to have your subject in a more suspenseful pose...perhaps head turned left or right and arms and legs cocked ready to bolt.</td>', 'The flashlight doesn''t work for me. However....the rest of the image is just perfect. Especially how the tree is just a bit off kilter.  A suggestion which may also work well is to have your subject in a more suspenseful pose...perhaps head turned left or right and arms and legs cocked ready to bolt.', '2005-05-09 17:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373889, 174530, 24212, '<td valign="top">A really dream-like picture.The lighting in the foreground (I presume it has been dodged and burned) is excellent. A nice glow o the picture.</td>', 'A really dream-like picture.The lighting in the foreground (I presume it has been dodged and burned) is excellent. A nice glow o the picture.', '2005-05-09 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373892, 174308, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great effect. Like the crop. The plaintive expression works well here.</td>', 'Great effect. Like the crop. The plaintive expression works well here.', '2005-05-09 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373902, 173011, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field and lots of detail.Some of the sky looks a bit overexposed and the very bottom of the tree trunk looks to be in rather soft focus.</td>', 'Great depth of field and lots of detail.Some of the sky looks a bit overexposed and the very bottom of the tree trunk looks to be in rather soft focus.', '2005-05-09 18:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373905, 174583, 24212, '<td valign="top">A very placid scene. I wonder if this would be even better with a bit of the frame cropped off at the top.</td>', 'A very placid scene. I wonder if this would be even better with a bit of the frame cropped off at the top.', '2005-05-09 18:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373907, 174066, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the colour, but wonder how good this would look with the tree on the right cropped off.</td>', 'I love the colour, but wonder how good this would look with the tree on the right cropped off.', '2005-05-09 18:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373915, 174216, 24212, '<td valign="top">The lighting''s great and everything is superbly sharp. I think it might look better without the power lines running through it.</td>', 'The lighting''s great and everything is superbly sharp. I think it might look better without the power lines running through it.', '2005-05-09 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373917, 173823, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours. I''d just perhaps like to see a touch more DOF and a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'Lovely colours. I''d just perhaps like to see a touch more DOF and a bit more sharpness.', '2005-05-09 18:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373925, 173431, 24212, '<td valign="top">I wonder whether this would benefit from a bit more sharpening, especially some of the rocks.</td>', 'I wonder whether this would benefit from a bit more sharpening, especially some of the rocks.', '2005-05-09 18:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373930, 174186, 24212, '<td valign="top">I guess that you''re a worrier, like me. If anything, I''d have to say that I''d like to see this cropped from the right to get rid of the post that intrudes into the frame.</td>', 'I guess that you''re a worrier, like me. If anything, I''d have to say that I''d like to see this cropped from the right to get rid of the post that intrudes into the frame.', '2005-05-09 18:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373937, 172150, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the use of selective desaturation here. The fact that the colours left behind are not too ''in your face'' is welcome. I also like the soft-focus effect, although I feel that the sleeves of the jacket could perhaps do with being somewhat sharper.</td>', 'I like the use of selective desaturation here. The fact that the colours left behind are not too ''in your face'' is welcome. I also like the soft-focus effect, although I feel that the sleeves of the jacket could perhaps do with being somewhat sharper.', '2005-05-09 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373940, 174020, 24212, '<td valign="top">I''d just like to say that I don''t seem to have dreams as vivid, scary or interesting as yours.</td>', 'I''d just like to say that I don''t seem to have dreams as vivid, scary or interesting as yours.', '2005-05-09 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373945, 174021, 24212, '<td valign="top">Getting shots like this is very difficult, as the lighting is hard to get right. Unfortunately, I can''t seem to work out what''s going on here.</td>', 'Getting shots like this is very difficult, as the lighting is hard to get right. Unfortunately, I can''t seem to work out what''s going on here.', '2005-05-09 18:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373949, 174270, 24212, '<td valign="top">He looks almost as if you asked him to pose for the camera and he understood you. Anyway, do you really dream of lions?</td>', 'He looks almost as if you asked him to pose for the camera and he understood you. Anyway, do you really dream of lions?', '2005-05-09 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373951, 174585, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. Lovely colours.The composition''s good, too. There''s plenty to look at.</td>', 'Great DOF. Lovely colours.The composition''s good, too. There''s plenty to look at.', '2005-05-09 18:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373952, 172853, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wow. You''ve captured this really well. I''ve tried to get shots in the fog like this, but they''ve never come out as well as this.</td>', 'Wow. You''ve captured this really well. I''ve tried to get shots in the fog like this, but they''ve never come out as well as this.', '2005-05-09 18:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374004, 174643, 35804, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool! Something that actually looks dreamlike...or a bit nightmarish in this case. This is great...love the darkness, the limited color pallette, the skewed perspective, It took me a bit to figure out what the image actually was ( silly doggie )   : } ...this is really fantastic!...you captured my attention, sucked me in and now I feel rewarded some how. I really hope people take their time with this image and don''t get hung up on what they might think the technical problems are....one can dream can''t they?</td>', 'REALLY cool! Something that actually looks dreamlike...or a bit nightmarish in this case. This is great...love the darkness, the limited color pallette, the skewed perspective, It took me a bit to figure out what the image actually was ( silly doggie )   : } ...this is really fantastic!...you captured my attention, sucked me in and now I feel rewarded some how. I really hope people take their time with this image and don''t get hung up on what they might think the technical problems are....one can dream can''t they?', '2005-05-09 19:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374005, 173644, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love this! Awesome colors, completely wacky, completely wonderful, TOTALLY CREATIVE!....sorry...I''ll stop screaming now but this really stands out...apparently alot of people having really boring dreams....glad to see that some else really stepped up to the plate with this challenge, an incredible oppurtunity to do something completely fun....technically, I think it''s fine, just a really cool image.</td>', 'I love this! Awesome colors, completely wacky, completely wonderful, TOTALLY CREATIVE!....sorry...I''ll stop screaming now but this really stands out...apparently alot of people having really boring dreams....glad to see that some else really stepped up to the plate with this challenge, an incredible oppurtunity to do something completely fun....technically, I think it''s fine, just a really cool image.', '2005-05-09 19:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374672, 174301, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It looks simple at first glance,  but the more I look at it, the more I love it.  Definitely a top favorite for me!  The clouds are beautiful, the lighting is fantastic.  The tree.....the tree is just perfect.  I know where I''m going to visit when I sleep tonight!</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It looks simple at first glance,  but the more I look at it, the more I love it.  Definitely a top favorite for me!  The clouds are beautiful, the lighting is fantastic.  The tree.....the tree is just perfect.  I know where I''m going to visit when I sleep tonight!', '2005-05-10 03:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374673, 174697, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity of this shot.  The foliage in the background gives nice color and depth to the shot.  Great job!</td>', 'I love the clarity of this shot.  The foliage in the background gives nice color and depth to the shot.  Great job!', '2005-05-10 03:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374674, 172456, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot!  Great shillouette of the hand as well.  Good job!</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot!  Great shillouette of the hand as well.  Good job!', '2005-05-10 03:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374675, 174077, 35513, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the sharpest, clearest image I have ever seen in a challenge so far!  REALLY excellent job.  Just a beautiful shot.</td>', 'This has got to be the sharpest, clearest image I have ever seen in a challenge so far!  REALLY excellent job.  Just a beautiful shot.', '2005-05-10 03:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374676, 174528, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity on this shot.  I really like the flower, especially the way that one of the petals is bent downwards.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity on this shot.  I really like the flower, especially the way that one of the petals is bent downwards.  Good lighting.', '2005-05-10 03:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374677, 172574, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  No idea what it is, but I like it!!</td>', 'Great colors!  No idea what it is, but I like it!!', '2005-05-10 03:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374680, 173338, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice even horizon.  Great shot.</td>', 'Good lighting, nice even horizon.  Great shot.', '2005-05-10 03:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374681, 174681, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the surreal aspect of this shot.  It really looks neat!  Congrats on a great job.</td>', 'I really like the surreal aspect of this shot.  It really looks neat!  Congrats on a great job.', '2005-05-10 03:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374682, 174083, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the old time feel of this shot!!!  What a great way to make it dream like.  Very clear image, great positioning, great lighting.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the old time feel of this shot!!!  What a great way to make it dream like.  Very clear image, great positioning, great lighting.  Well done!', '2005-05-10 03:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374683, 172853, 35513, '<td valign="top">The mist really sets the mood for this shot.  The lamposts look GREAT!  Good positioning, I like the way the lamposts and the trees lead your eye along the fence and sidewalk.</td>', 'The mist really sets the mood for this shot.  The lamposts look GREAT!  Good positioning, I like the way the lamposts and the trees lead your eye along the fence and sidewalk.', '2005-05-10 03:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374684, 173097, 35513, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness I''ve seen that look on my face during finals week!  Great job capturing the insanity of the studious!  Good lighting, great shadows.  Well done.</td>', 'Oh my goodness I''ve seen that look on my face during finals week!  Great job capturing the insanity of the studious!  Good lighting, great shadows.  Well done.', '2005-05-10 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374686, 174530, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is a very soothing image...just beautiful.  Very peaceful, and very much the misty surrealism that all the best dreams have :-)  Great shot!</td>', 'This is a very soothing image...just beautiful.  Very peaceful, and very much the misty surrealism that all the best dreams have :-)  Great shot!', '2005-05-10 03:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374688, 174429, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t be one of my favorite dreams!!  But it''s a great shot nonetheless....can''t argue with that!  The picture is crystal clear!  Only minor gripe would be that the top of the chicken''s head is missing...but the eye is in such a great place that I''m not sure it really bothers me.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Wouldn''t be one of my favorite dreams!!  But it''s a great shot nonetheless....can''t argue with that!  The picture is crystal clear!  Only minor gripe would be that the top of the chicken''s head is missing...but the eye is in such a great place that I''m not sure it really bothers me.  Excellent shot.', '2005-05-10 03:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374689, 174400, 35513, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tad too blurry for my own tastes, but it''s very reminiscent of many impressionistic works.  Beautiful colors and a gorgeous setting for a picture and a dream!  Lighting looks good.</td>', 'Perhaps a tad too blurry for my own tastes, but it''s very reminiscent of many impressionistic works.  Beautiful colors and a gorgeous setting for a picture and a dream!  Lighting looks good.', '2005-05-10 03:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374691, 174459, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot with lots of color gradients that pull the landscape together.  The image of the person walking definitely makes it feel more dreamlike.</td>', 'Very clear shot with lots of color gradients that pull the landscape together.  The image of the person walking definitely makes it feel more dreamlike.', '2005-05-10 03:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374692, 173823, 35513, '<td valign="top">A beautifully clear shot!  Great focus and lighting.  Would love to see the inside of the flower, but the closed bloom makes a wonderful statement as well.  Great shot!</td>', 'A beautifully clear shot!  Great focus and lighting.  Would love to see the inside of the flower, but the closed bloom makes a wonderful statement as well.  Great shot!', '2005-05-10 03:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374694, 173500, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred ducks....the grass is very green and looks lovely.  I have to say that the hand is a little distracting, though I see what you were going for.  I wouldn''t want to be attacked by that many ducks either!</td>', 'I like the blurred ducks....the grass is very green and looks lovely.  I have to say that the hand is a little distracting, though I see what you were going for.  I wouldn''t want to be attacked by that many ducks either!', '2005-05-10 03:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374697, 173886, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very clear image....great focus.  I think that the lighting gives it something of a yellow feel, which may be what you were going for.  I''m curious to know what it would look like with a little more shadow, or perhaps just a less intense light.  But a well captured shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Very clear image....great focus.  I think that the lighting gives it something of a yellow feel, which may be what you were going for.  I''m curious to know what it would look like with a little more shadow, or perhaps just a less intense light.  But a well captured shot nonetheless.', '2005-05-10 03:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374699, 174021, 35513, '<td valign="top">Definitely has dreamlike quality.  Lighting looks good and the focus is nice as well.  Good stable shot.  At first I thought I might like to see some more black in the shadows, as opposed to dark grey, but when you look closer there are lots of details that would get lost if you did that.  So I changed my mind :-)  nice shot!</td>', 'Definitely has dreamlike quality.  Lighting looks good and the focus is nice as well.  Good stable shot.  At first I thought I might like to see some more black in the shadows, as opposed to dark grey, but when you look closer there are lots of details that would get lost if you did that.  So I changed my mind :-)  nice shot!', '2005-05-10 03:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374700, 174290, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on this shot.  The glare from the lighting is slightly distracting.  I like the two images blurred together...very surreal.</td>', 'Nice colors on this shot.  The glare from the lighting is slightly distracting.  I like the two images blurred together...very surreal.', '2005-05-10 03:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374702, 173644, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot of all those veggies!  I like the rainbow colors throughout.  Definitely an interesting setup :-)  I like it.</td>', 'Nice clear shot of all those veggies!  I like the rainbow colors throughout.  Definitely an interesting setup :-)  I like it.', '2005-05-10 03:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374704, 174486, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good shillouette.  I think at sunset that this would be just spectacular!</td>', 'Good shillouette.  I think at sunset that this would be just spectacular!', '2005-05-10 03:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374705, 172457, 35513, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous house!  Nice placement of everything in the photo.  It might be a little more interesting if it weren''t an overcast day.  Good clarity and detail.</td>', 'Gorgeous house!  Nice placement of everything in the photo.  It might be a little more interesting if it weren''t an overcast day.  Good clarity and detail.', '2005-05-10 03:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374706, 173514, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful waterfall!  I''d love to know where you shot this.  It''s a touch too soft for my tastes.  It gives a dreamlike quallity, but I loose a lot of the detail that my eye wants to see.  Perhaps somewhere in between sharp and this soft?  Good lighting and good placement.</td>', 'Beautiful waterfall!  I''d love to know where you shot this.  It''s a touch too soft for my tastes.  It gives a dreamlike quallity, but I loose a lot of the detail that my eye wants to see.  Perhaps somewhere in between sharp and this soft?  Good lighting and good placement.', '2005-05-10 03:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374707, 173011, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue sky!!!  I like the angle of this shot.  I''m not sure if it''s solar flare or just brownish leaves, but it''s slightly distracting.  Great focus on this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful blue sky!!!  I like the angle of this shot.  I''m not sure if it''s solar flare or just brownish leaves, but it''s slightly distracting.  Great focus on this shot.', '2005-05-10 03:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374709, 174320, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this photo!  There seems to be a bit of glare in the center, perhaps from the sun?  It''s slightly distracting.  But other than that it''s a beautiful landscape!<br/></td>', 'I love the colors in this photo!  There seems to be a bit of glare in the center, perhaps from the sun?  It''s slightly distracting.  But other than that it''s a beautiful landscape!', '2005-05-10 03:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374712, 174484, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting indeed!!!  And very creative :-)  Certainly sounds like a lot of strange dreams that I''ve had.  It''s a bit too noisy for my tastes.  I think that a little bit of noise does add to the dreamlike quality of the photo, but in my opinion I would like to see a little less.  VERY interesting subject.  Nice to have something unusual to look at :-)</td>', 'Very interesting indeed!!!  And very creative :-)  Certainly sounds like a lot of strange dreams that I''ve had.  It''s a bit too noisy for my tastes.  I think that a little bit of noise does add to the dreamlike quality of the photo, but in my opinion I would like to see a little less.  VERY interesting subject.  Nice to have something unusual to look at :-)', '2005-05-10 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374714, 173923, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this shot!  It''s incredible!  I think that perhaps there is a little too much glow overall....it edges off of dreamlike and into too bright in some areas.  But a lovely, lovely shot!  What a beautiful girl!!</td>', 'I really like the composition of this shot!  It''s incredible!  I think that perhaps there is a little too much glow overall....it edges off of dreamlike and into too bright in some areas.  But a lovely, lovely shot!  What a beautiful girl!!', '2005-05-10 03:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374719, 174400, 31275, '<td valign="top">Honestly......What were you taking in the 70''s to think of this image?  I''m getting flashbacks.......Oh my head!</td>', 'Honestly......What were you taking in the 70''s to think of this image?  I''m getting flashbacks.......Oh my head!', '2005-05-10 03:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374733, 173989, 15497, '<td valign="top">Konge bilde! 10</td>', 'Konge bilde! 10', '2005-05-10 04:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374774, 174583, 35720, '<td valign="top">Very good and dreamy shot, soft with beautiful colours. I like how the water leads the eye into the image. Well done!</td>', 'Very good and dreamy shot, soft with beautiful colours. I like how the water leads the eye into the image. Well done!', '2005-05-10 05:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374780, 174429, 35720, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but I am not keen on the composition and framing. I would like to see the cock more to the left looking into some space in the frame and there is too much crop on the top in my opinion. The background esp to the left distracts me a bit and would have been better more blurred IMO. But the cock itself is sharp and I like the colours.</td>', 'Nice capture, but I am not keen on the composition and framing. I would like to see the cock more to the left looking into some space in the frame and there is too much crop on the top in my opinion. The background esp to the left distracts me a bit and would have been better more blurred IMO. But the cock itself is sharp and I like the colours.', '2005-05-10 05:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374781, 174216, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very dreamy, mystic and atmospheric. The only thing in this image that distracts a bit IMHO is the house to the right and the lines in the background. Very good shot nevertheless. 8</td>', 'Great shot, very dreamy, mystic and atmospheric. The only thing in this image that distracts a bit IMHO is the house to the right and the lines in the background. Very good shot nevertheless. 8', '2005-05-10 06:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374802, 173276, 30018, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.  Very nice.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Simple but effective.  Very nice.  <7>', '2005-05-10 07:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374803, 173097, 30018, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmm...seems more like a Nightmare to me!   &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Hmmmmmm...seems more like a Nightmare to me!   <7>', '2005-05-10 07:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374804, 173514, 34852, '<td valign="top">Hahaa!! So funny!! :)) Thanks for the laughs! [8]</td>', 'Hahaa!! So funny!! :)) Thanks for the laughs! [8]', '2005-05-10 07:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374805, 174643, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wild dream...interesting image.  Can''t wait to check back later to see how you did all this.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Wild dream...interesting image.  Can''t wait to check back later to see how you did all this.  <7>', '2005-05-10 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374806, 173541, 30018, '<td valign="top">Waiting for the "Last Train to Clarksville", huh?  Sorry, couldn''t resist.  Cool image. Great lighting, and nice textures throughout.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Waiting for the "Last Train to Clarksville", huh?  Sorry, couldn''t resist.  Cool image. Great lighting, and nice textures throughout.  <7>', '2005-05-10 07:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374807, 174313, 30018, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, you really catch a guys heart with an image.  Wow, does this bring back wonderful memories.  I was that future big leaguer when I was his age.  Nice shot.  B&amp;W is perfect for this shot.  I''ll bet this one is hanging on the wall in someone''s bedroom already.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Sometimes, you really catch a guys heart with an image.  Wow, does this bring back wonderful memories.  I was that future big leaguer when I was his age.  Nice shot.  B&W is perfect for this shot.  I''ll bet this one is hanging on the wall in someone''s bedroom already.  <7>', '2005-05-10 07:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374809, 173992, 30018, '<td valign="top">I must say, graduation had a very different meaning to me, but very nice image.  Seems I''ve seen this somewhere before however.  Image has nice dreamy effect, but I always have a hard time with the lack originality.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I must say, graduation had a very different meaning to me, but very nice image.  Seems I''ve seen this somewhere before however.  Image has nice dreamy effect, but I always have a hard time with the lack originality.  <6>', '2005-05-10 07:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374812, 174609, 30018, '<td valign="top">Looks like an Iron Butterfly dream.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Looks like an Iron Butterfly dream.  <5>', '2005-05-10 07:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374817, 172832, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you are trying to capture here.  The model in the photo does not look as if he is dreaming, simply by the position of his hand, as it does not look relaxed.  It is possible that the viewer is supposed to be dreaming of this individual.  That works for me a little better.  I like the lighting, and the tonal completeness of the image, but I''m honestly just not completely sure about the composition itself.  My problem, not yours.  Very nice image.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I''m not sure what you are trying to capture here.  The model in the photo does not look as if he is dreaming, simply by the position of his hand, as it does not look relaxed.  It is possible that the viewer is supposed to be dreaming of this individual.  That works for me a little better.  I like the lighting, and the tonal completeness of the image, but I''m honestly just not completely sure about the composition itself.  My problem, not yours.  Very nice image.  <8>', '2005-05-10 07:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374821, 174210, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea...hope it works out for you.</td>', 'Nice idea...hope it works out for you.', '2005-05-10 07:20:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1374823, 173431, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the colors, more than the flowing action, give me the dreamy feeling.  Very nice.  &lt;8&gt;<br/>I''m back again, and bumping it up a notch...hope you don''t mind  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Interesting how the colors, more than the flowing action, give me the dreamy feeling.  Very nice.  <8>I''m back again, and bumping it up a notch...hope you don''t mind  <9>', '2005-05-10 07:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374826, 173176, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''ll be curiouse to check back and see how this one does.  Sex always sells, but this one caught my eye because it if filled the frames of the image and was very simple, with interesting colors and wonderful detail with that very nice DOF which makes if feel dreamy.  I like this, not for it''s sex appeal, but for it''s simplicity.  Very nice.  I hope it does well.  &lt;9&gt;<br/>I''m back again...and gonna push this one up one more notch, as I think this is the nicest overall image in the challege.  Hope you don''t mind  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'I''ll be curiouse to check back and see how this one does.  Sex always sells, but this one caught my eye because it if filled the frames of the image and was very simple, with interesting colors and wonderful detail with that very nice DOF which makes if feel dreamy.  I like this, not for it''s sex appeal, but for it''s simplicity.  Very nice.  I hope it does well.  <9>I''m back again...and gonna push this one up one more notch, as I think this is the nicest overall image in the challege.  Hope you don''t mind  <10>', '2005-05-10 07:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374963, 172590, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  I''m guessing a play or re-enactment of some sort?  Now the title would probably fit better if she didn''t have that look of utter shock and disgust on her face, LOL! :)<br/> <br/>I like the choice of using sepia for this because of the costumes the people are wearing but just a few things botter me with the shot.  The sunglasses on her dress, out of character and period, could have been cloned and for some reason the balance seems off.  The way the people are sitting when I look to the center of the shot it''s the bench and even though you have two people on one side and one on the other the overall shot doesn''t feel like an off balance teeter totter, does that make sense?  Using my magic envelope, if you had cropped just a little bit more on the left, taking out the wall and poster it seems to balance just a little better overall.<br/>A 9<br/>Deannda<br/>Again, great capture</td>', 'What a great shot!  I''m guessing a play or re-enactment of some sort?  Now the title would probably fit better if she didn''t have that look of utter shock and disgust on her face, LOL! :) I like the choice of using sepia for this because of the costumes the people are wearing but just a few things botter me with the shot.  The sunglasses on her dress, out of character and period, could have been cloned and for some reason the balance seems off.  The way the people are sitting when I look to the center of the shot it''s the bench and even though you have two people on one side and one on the other the overall shot doesn''t feel like an off balance teeter totter, does that make sense?  Using my magic envelope, if you had cropped just a little bit more on the left, taking out the wall and poster it seems to balance just a little better overall.A 9DeanndaAgain, great capture', '2005-05-10 09:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374968, 174530, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very nice indeed.  Wish my dreams looked this this, LOL!  I like the feel of the overall shot, the composition, the balance, the only thing that throws me off just a bit is the dark lower left corner.  Maybe you were going for the idea that the dream fades off into nothingness but I''m not really good at the in depth meaning of most shots, I just know if I like it or not, LOL! :O  The corner doesn''t really bother me so much, it does work well, it''s just the way it suddenly goes black, a more subtle fade might have worked better for my taste personally.<br/> <br/>A 9<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'Very nice, very nice indeed.  Wish my dreams looked this this, LOL!  I like the feel of the overall shot, the composition, the balance, the only thing that throws me off just a bit is the dark lower left corner.  Maybe you were going for the idea that the dream fades off into nothingness but I''m not really good at the in depth meaning of most shots, I just know if I like it or not, LOL! :O  The corner doesn''t really bother me so much, it does work well, it''s just the way it suddenly goes black, a more subtle fade might have worked better for my taste personally. A 9 Deannda', '2005-05-10 09:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374983, 174320, 15711, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Texas hill country.  VERY nice!</td>', 'Reminds me of the Texas hill country.  VERY nice!', '2005-05-10 09:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375085, 173977, 35804, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this picture makes it super nice... nicely creative too! This is one of the few pictures from this challenge that has stuck in my mind...there is something very magical about it.</td>', 'The simplicity of this picture makes it super nice... nicely creative too! This is one of the few pictures from this challenge that has stuck in my mind...there is something very magical about it.', '2005-05-10 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375088, 174216, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love the light in this picture...the giant "glowing tree"...to me the picture has a slightly sinister feel to it...but that''s probably because I''ve had too many nightmares with people chasing me...really effective and powerful photo, nicely done.</td>', 'I love the light in this picture...the giant "glowing tree"...to me the picture has a slightly sinister feel to it...but that''s probably because I''ve had too many nightmares with people chasing me...really effective and powerful photo, nicely done.', '2005-05-10 10:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375090, 174446, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the humor and the creepy light...very dreamy/nightmary...and very creative!</td>', 'Love the humor and the creepy light...very dreamy/nightmary...and very creative!', '2005-05-10 10:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375092, 174696, 35804, '<td valign="top">So odd and simple...so perfect for this challenge...love the soft colors...this is so relaxing to look at.</td>', 'So odd and simple...so perfect for this challenge...love the soft colors...this is so relaxing to look at.', '2005-05-10 10:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375104, 174208, 35804, '<td valign="top">I usually do not like motion blurry type pictures but it is so effective in this picture! I think it''s because it''2 use  doesn''t seem gimmicky here...it helps tell the story, and the B&amp;W keeps it simple. The "time traveling" feel to this is really effective, curious, and really creative. The compostion is spot on and the "grain" just appeals to past times. Really nice!</td>', 'I usually do not like motion blurry type pictures but it is so effective in this picture! I think it''s because it''2 use  doesn''t seem gimmicky here...it helps tell the story, and the B&W keeps it simple. The "time traveling" feel to this is really effective, curious, and really creative. The compostion is spot on and the "grain" just appeals to past times. Really nice!', '2005-05-10 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375107, 174650, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is just really funny! The title is perfection and sooooooooo true!</td>', 'This is just really funny! The title is perfection and sooooooooo true!', '2005-05-10 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375110, 172150, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of selective des. here...the use of the blur is super effective. This is so imaginative...fantastic picture.</td>', 'I really like the use of selective des. here...the use of the blur is super effective. This is so imaginative...fantastic picture.', '2005-05-10 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375337, 174547, 35720, '<td valign="top">Very good shot vith good combination of lines and shapes, lights and shadows.  Have a nice dreams!</td>', 'Very good shot vith good combination of lines and shapes, lights and shadows.  Have a nice dreams!', '2005-05-10 12:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
