(1375842, 172096, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good dream picture - it fits what I imagine a dream to be, for my taste, it''s missing something. I can''t put my finger on what, though. Maybe a bird or something? The composition seems good overall, however.</td>', 'Good dream picture - it fits what I imagine a dream to be, for my taste, it''s missing something. I can''t put my finger on what, though. Maybe a bird or something? The composition seems good overall, however.', '2005-05-10 16:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375849, 172574, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the colors. Wish you would''ve used the entire 640 that you''re allowed, though.</td>', 'I like the title and the colors. Wish you would''ve used the entire 640 that you''re allowed, though.', '2005-05-10 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375853, 172613, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, cute title and nice picture. Ths DPC:er is a flower lover, especially when they''re placed in such a cool (upside down) orientation. Very sharp, interesting DOF, and beautiful colors here.</td>', 'Ah, cute title and nice picture. Ths DPC:er is a flower lover, especially when they''re placed in such a cool (upside down) orientation. Very sharp, interesting DOF, and beautiful colors here.', '2005-05-10 16:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375863, 173619, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. I had to look at it for quite a while to actually recognize the person "falling". It''s a good thing you had the title, because otherwise I would have wondered why you dream of touching your toes and flipping the picture upside down :-) Thanks for making me think - and for making me realize I should spend longer looking at the images!</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. I had to look at it for quite a while to actually recognize the person "falling". It''s a good thing you had the title, because otherwise I would have wondered why you dream of touching your toes and flipping the picture upside down :-) Thanks for making me think - and for making me realize I should spend longer looking at the images!', '2005-05-10 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375869, 173541, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I wish the ghost person could''ve been standing either to the left or to the right of the support on the train shelter. Nice and sharp otherwise, with good placement of all the elements (except for the guy). Fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I wish the ghost person could''ve been standing either to the left or to the right of the support on the train shelter. Nice and sharp otherwise, with good placement of all the elements (except for the guy). Fits the challenge very well.', '2005-05-10 16:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375874, 174620, 31133, '<td valign="top">With the title, a perfect challenge fit. I wish the horizon were level, but maybe you intended it to be slightly at an angle, since it''s a dream.</td>', 'With the title, a perfect challenge fit. I wish the horizon were level, but maybe you intended it to be slightly at an angle, since it''s a dream.', '2005-05-10 16:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375922, 174695, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, very amusing. I would, perhaps, like to see it a bit sharper and the colour of the tiger seems a bit strange.</td>', 'I like this a lot, very amusing. I would, perhaps, like to see it a bit sharper and the colour of the tiger seems a bit strange.', '2005-05-10 16:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
