(1375931, 174208, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the overall effect. The fact that the hand and profile of the face are relatively clear is a good thing.</td>', 'I like the overall effect. The fact that the hand and profile of the face are relatively clear is a good thing.', '2005-05-10 16:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
