(1376630, 174066, 368, '<td valign="top">ahh wide open spaces .. definitly can see future and freedom ... I kinda wish that the horizon of the photo was a little lower than closer to the center - but the colors are nice and vivid</td>', 'ahh wide open spaces .. definitly can see future and freedom ... I kinda wish that the horizon of the photo was a little lower than closer to the center - but the colors are nice and vivid', '2005-05-10 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1376631, 174687, 368, '<td valign="top">ooh ... this image is messing with my eyes .. but i guess that''s what dreams do is mess with peoples minds .. i dont know where to really focus on - yet i go straight to the middle ... very interesting .. i like it</td>', 'ooh ... this image is messing with my eyes .. but i guess that''s what dreams do is mess with peoples minds .. i dont know where to really focus on - yet i go straight to the middle ... very interesting .. i like it', '2005-05-10 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
