(1379532, 173338, 15207, '<td valign="top">THis is stunning! I love the reflection in the wet sand - and perfect with the small silhouette - 9</td>', 'THis is stunning! I love the reflection in the wet sand - and perfect with the small silhouette - 9', '2005-05-11 18:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
