(1380654, 174688, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the soft focus and think it was the correct choice for this challenge.  Good colours and focus and pretty much the only thing I could say that could have been done better is the composition wich I think is too centered and I personally don´t find this very interesting.  Gave it an 8 though, I like it.</td>', 'Nice, I like the soft focus and think it was the correct choice for this challenge.  Good colours and focus and pretty much the only thing I could say that could have been done better is the composition wich I think is too centered and I personally don´t find this very interesting.  Gave it an 8 though, I like it.', '2005-05-12 07:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380658, 174600, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lovely location you found here, I don´t think there is anything wrong with this shot at all, good clarity, sharpness, colours and contrast.  I just don´t find it very interesting, that´s all.  Also, I can´t help but wonder what the rest of the lake looks like, without having a clue on what is to the right of the frame here I desperatly want to find out and I feel when I am looking at this as this is just the left half of the shot and you cut out the right half.  Anyway, still way better than most shots in the challenge and very well technically done, I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Lovely location you found here, I don´t think there is anything wrong with this shot at all, good clarity, sharpness, colours and contrast.  I just don´t find it very interesting, that´s all.  Also, I can´t help but wonder what the rest of the lake looks like, without having a clue on what is to the right of the frame here I desperatly want to find out and I feel when I am looking at this as this is just the left half of the shot and you cut out the right half.  Anyway, still way better than most shots in the challenge and very well technically done, I gave it an 8.', '2005-05-12 07:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380664, 173500, 27482, '<td valign="top">Valildated or not, that hand just looks out of place and well to be honest, looks pretty bad.  I think the idea is good and I really like the movement of the ducks, but that hand drags this shot way way way down.  Anyway, still good though but if you would have had a normal looking hand and perhaps a little less colour noise in the ducks it would have potentially been an 8 or a 9 from me even, and I don´t give out many of those so keep it up.</td>', 'Valildated or not, that hand just looks out of place and well to be honest, looks pretty bad.  I think the idea is good and I really like the movement of the ducks, but that hand drags this shot way way way down.  Anyway, still good though but if you would have had a normal looking hand and perhaps a little less colour noise in the ducks it would have potentially been an 8 or a 9 from me even, and I don´t give out many of those so keep it up.', '2005-05-12 08:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
