(1381146, 173989, 15207, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. You took full advantage of light and the composition is excellent. 9</td>', 'Beautiful. You took full advantage of light and the composition is excellent. 9', '2005-05-12 12:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381193, 174077, 23653, '<td valign="top">I want your lens so bad........9</td>', 'I want your lens so bad........9', '2005-05-12 13:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381196, 174695, 23653, '<td valign="top">too cool....</td>', 'too cool....', '2005-05-12 13:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381198, 174301, 23653, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, I know its a dream but I would like to see this image without the vignetting.....still gave it a ...10</td>', 'beautiful image, I know its a dream but I would like to see this image without the vignetting.....still gave it a ...10', '2005-05-12 13:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381207, 173338, 23653, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I think the compositon could be better, the horizon splits the photo right down the center.  I think off setting it a little would do wonders for this photo.   Overall I think its a great photo.... I still gave it a ....9</td>', 'Nice capture, I think the compositon could be better, the horizon splits the photo right down the center.  I think off setting it a little would do wonders for this photo.   Overall I think its a great photo.... I still gave it a ....9', '2005-05-12 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381217, 173059, 23653, '<td valign="top">Great use of the fisheye, well composed burning the sky a little on th left side would be nice, and a bit more saturation on the flowers.    great image.......9</td>', 'Great use of the fisheye, well composed burning the sky a little on th left side would be nice, and a bit more saturation on the flowers.    great image.......9', '2005-05-12 13:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381222, 174643, 23653, '<td valign="top">Amazing work how do you do this, makes me think of payote?........9</td>', 'Amazing work how do you do this, makes me think of payote?........9', '2005-05-12 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381225, 172150, 23653, '<td valign="top">Very dreamlike, good job......9</td>', 'Very dreamlike, good job......9', '2005-05-12 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381227, 172844, 23653, '<td valign="top">This is one scary imaage wierd.......10</td>', 'This is one scary imaage wierd.......10', '2005-05-12 13:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381231, 174546, 23653, '<td valign="top">oh almost, almost, almost, wake up, no must get blue ribbon..........9</td>', 'oh almost, almost, almost, wake up, no must get blue ribbon..........9', '2005-05-12 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381328, 174074, 35720, '<td valign="top">Very good shot,sharp with good dark background.</td>', 'Very good shot,sharp with good dark background.', '2005-05-12 13:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381468, 173276, 34192, '<td valign="top">The sky perfectly enhances the sculpture.  just the right amount of texture.  Good balance.  9  - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The sky perfectly enhances the sculpture.  just the right amount of texture.  Good balance.  9  - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-12 14:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381488, 174367, 34192, '<td valign="top">Looks oversharpened.  The expression on his face is great! Came back for a second look.  Still love the expression on his face.  Change my thought on the oversharpened.  He''s just going grey.  Definitely the expression gets it - 8 from me - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Looks oversharpened.  The expression on his face is great! Came back for a second look.  Still love the expression on his face.  Change my thought on the oversharpened.  He''s just going grey.  Definitely the expression gets it - 8 from me - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-12 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381496, 173338, 34192, '<td valign="top">Really cool.  Love the conversion done.  So much more powerful in B&amp;W.  Love the tonal shifts - you made excellent use of the range.  The subject is almost too far out of the image, but not quite.  Do like him/her at the edge though.  And going out of the frame works for me.  9 for your excellent use of black.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Really cool.  Love the conversion done.  So much more powerful in B&W.  Love the tonal shifts - you made excellent use of the range.  The subject is almost too far out of the image, but not quite.  Do like him/her at the edge though.  And going out of the frame works for me.  9 for your excellent use of black.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-05-12 14:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381503, 174696, 34192, '<td valign="top">I went back and forth with the color of the umbrella.  I decided you were right - that shade of blue works best.  And I think the sand color blanket is also an excellent choice.  the range of blues is very peaceful and relaxing - perfect for a dreams shot.  Love the way he is holding his shoes - very telling and almost conflicts with the rest of the image.  I really enjoyed viewing this - thanks for sharing! 8 from me - good luck!</td>', 'I went back and forth with the color of the umbrella.  I decided you were right - that shade of blue works best.  And I think the sand color blanket is also an excellent choice.  the range of blues is very peaceful and relaxing - perfect for a dreams shot.  Love the way he is holding his shoes - very telling and almost conflicts with the rest of the image.  I really enjoyed viewing this - thanks for sharing! 8 from me - good luck!', '2005-05-12 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381534, 174484, 28807, '<td valign="top">Would''ve thought your dreams involved eyes rather than apples....</td>', 'Would''ve thought your dreams involved eyes rather than apples....', '2005-05-12 15:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381702, 173059, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Fish eye? Nice, soft lighting on her face.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Fish eye? Nice, soft lighting on her face.', '2005-05-12 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381708, 174313, 33947, '<td valign="top">I think this one captures the essence of the challenge really, really well. Nice composition. Sharp! My favorite for the challenge.</td>', 'I think this one captures the essence of the challenge really, really well. Nice composition. Sharp! My favorite for the challenge.', '2005-05-12 16:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381712, 174083, 33947, '<td valign="top">This one meets the challenge very well. The line and composition are perfect. Like the sepia. Nice cntrast and highlights.</td>', 'This one meets the challenge very well. The line and composition are perfect. Like the sepia. Nice cntrast and highlights.', '2005-05-12 16:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381716, 172944, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. I like the palm frond at the top.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. I like the palm frond at the top.', '2005-05-12 16:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381725, 174430, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp photo. I like the highlights in her eyes, and the soft lighting.</td>', 'Beautifully sharp photo. I like the highlights in her eyes, and the soft lighting.', '2005-05-12 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381728, 173886, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting, and the highlights on the chain.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting, and the highlights on the chain.', '2005-05-12 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381740, 174661, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. I like that you took a chance with something different. The center, lit-up part is gorgeous. I like the impressionistic feel.</td>', 'Interesting effect. I like that you took a chance with something different. The center, lit-up part is gorgeous. I like the impressionistic feel.', '2005-05-12 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381746, 174224, 33947, '<td valign="top">Lovely, soft light. I don''t know which special effect you used to get the slightly mottled effect, but, I think it worked really well. A few jaggies around the edges, but, they don''t detract much. In fact, that''s probably nitpicky. 7</td>', 'Lovely, soft light. I don''t know which special effect you used to get the slightly mottled effect, but, I think it worked really well. A few jaggies around the edges, but, they don''t detract much. In fact, that''s probably nitpicky. 7', '2005-05-12 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381750, 174485, 33947, '<td valign="top">I enjoy how sharp it is, and the soft lighting and highlighs. Nice contrast with background.</td>', 'I enjoy how sharp it is, and the soft lighting and highlighs. Nice contrast with background.', '2005-05-12 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381754, 173276, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast, and the beautiful colors and lighting of the sky. I also like how the statue is riding into the frame. Nice composition, nicely done.</td>', 'I love the contrast, and the beautiful colors and lighting of the sky. I also like how the statue is riding into the frame. Nice composition, nicely done.', '2005-05-12 16:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381774, 174367, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love that the lion is dreaming.  Great idea. Sharp and nicely lit.</td>', 'I love that the lion is dreaming.  Great idea. Sharp and nicely lit.', '2005-05-12 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381776, 174066, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like your dream, and I like the gentle and peaceful mood of your composition.</td>', 'I like your dream, and I like the gentle and peaceful mood of your composition.', '2005-05-12 17:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381780, 174691, 33947, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Creative. Nicely lit.</td>', 'Interesting effect. Creative. Nicely lit.', '2005-05-12 17:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381795, 172853, 33947, '<td valign="top">The light in the street lights is very appealing, and so is the fog. I love the quiet mood.</td>', 'The light in the street lights is very appealing, and so is the fog. I love the quiet mood.', '2005-05-12 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381804, 172590, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia, and line and composition. Works well.</td>', 'Love the sepia, and line and composition. Works well.', '2005-05-12 17:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381813, 174248, 33947, '<td valign="top">If that''s how your dreams start off, what a bummer. As a photo, though, I like the lighting very much on the swords, and the contrast with the background is nice.</td>', 'If that''s how your dreams start off, what a bummer. As a photo, though, I like the lighting very much on the swords, and the contrast with the background is nice.', '2005-05-12 17:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381832, 174484, 6130, '<td valign="top">LOL 10</td>', 'LOL 10', '2005-05-12 17:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381856, 174485, 3032, '<td valign="top">Love it how it completely stands out from the background. you could say there is no background, just emptyness, the sofa floats in emptyness. Dreams are like that, very focussed, when you become to aware of the surroundings you awake.<br/>The sofa and the light on the girl is perfect.</td>', 'Love it how it completely stands out from the background. you could say there is no background, just emptyness, the sofa floats in emptyness. Dreams are like that, very focussed, when you become to aware of the surroundings you awake.The sofa and the light on the girl is perfect.', '2005-05-12 17:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381860, 173338, 32608, '<td valign="top">love the composition, light rays coming through the clouds.  Tonal range a little to dark I think</td>', 'love the composition, light rays coming through the clouds.  Tonal range a little to dark I think', '2005-05-12 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381865, 173097, 3032, '<td valign="top">Is this a nightmare?<br/>Never passing that literature exam and still studying when you are already old and grey?<br/>Nice how the light falls. I wonder if that is a real person or a kind of wax dummy, looks like a styled museum room.</td>', 'Is this a nightmare?Never passing that literature exam and still studying when you are already old and grey?Nice how the light falls. I wonder if that is a real person or a kind of wax dummy, looks like a styled museum room.', '2005-05-12 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381868, 173989, 3032, '<td valign="top">While the bright spot on the floor is a bit annoying I still like the concept and the way it is done. Especially the way the backlight gives her body profile.</td>', 'While the bright spot on the floor is a bit annoying I still like the concept and the way it is done. Especially the way the backlight gives her body profile.', '2005-05-12 17:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381872, 172472, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective.</td>', 'Cool perspective.', '2005-05-12 17:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381877, 172293, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and colors.</td>', 'Wonderful light and colors.', '2005-05-12 17:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381878, 173514, 32767, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could have been great but way too much blurring. The title also kills the feel of a dreamy image....even though this peeing dream could be a very real thing for some...I suppose.</td>', 'Looks like it could have been great but way too much blurring. The title also kills the feel of a dreamy image....even though this peeing dream could be a very real thing for some...I suppose.', '2005-05-12 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381881, 174485, 32608, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  well done.</td>', 'beautiful.  well done.', '2005-05-12 17:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381889, 174083, 32767, '<td valign="top">I dream of sailing all the time. Love to sail. The use of those yellowish tones works so well for this shot where it might not for many others. It''s an interesting choice that you hit right on the head. Very nice work. Good Luck!!! 9</td>', 'I dream of sailing all the time. Love to sail. The use of those yellowish tones works so well for this shot where it might not for many others. It''s an interesting choice that you hit right on the head. Very nice work. Good Luck!!! 9', '2005-05-12 17:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381895, 174305, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, the greens and yellows of the leafes is a bit washed out exposure wise. I guess it wouldn''t hurt to give it more a bit more exposure compensation and to play with curves and shadow recovery a bit (if not already done that way).<br/>Despite that, I like that idea. 7</td>', 'Interesting view, the greens and yellows of the leafes is a bit washed out exposure wise. I guess it wouldn''t hurt to give it more a bit more exposure compensation and to play with curves and shadow recovery a bit (if not already done that way).Despite that, I like that idea. 7', '2005-05-12 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381897, 174429, 4411, '<td valign="top">You have strange dreams! : )<br/> <br/>Good sharp shot with some very nice detail especially around the eye, and good strong colour. Too central composition wise though - a square crop of just the right hand side would suit this great I think.</td>', 'You have strange dreams! : ) Good sharp shot with some very nice detail especially around the eye, and good strong colour. Too central composition wise though - a square crop of just the right hand side would suit this great I think.', '2005-05-12 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381899, 174505, 32767, '<td valign="top">This does have a very dreamy quality more so than many of the rest. bumping up. 8</td>', 'This does have a very dreamy quality more so than many of the rest. bumping up. 8', '2005-05-12 17:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381900, 174459, 36060, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the atmosphere, great colours.</td>', 'I like the composition and the atmosphere, great colours.', '2005-05-12 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381907, 174364, 32767, '<td valign="top">This struck me as an odd dream at first, since it''s not one of my dreams but then after a second look I realized to each his/her own dreams. It''s an intersting photo and more dreamlike than many other entries. Bumping up. 7</td>', 'This struck me as an odd dream at first, since it''s not one of my dreams but then after a second look I realized to each his/her own dreams. It''s an intersting photo and more dreamlike than many other entries. Bumping up. 7', '2005-05-12 17:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381909, 172293, 4411, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah.<br/>Bet I''m not the first to post a ''candles'' comment by saying it looks like a set of candles : )<br/>Painted light? A beautiful job however it was done. Less keen on the flower in the bottom right - maybe even better without it? The other two are absolutely spot on though.</td>', 'Oh yeah.Bet I''m not the first to post a ''candles'' comment by saying it looks like a set of candles : )Painted light? A beautiful job however it was done. Less keen on the flower in the bottom right - maybe even better without it? The other two are absolutely spot on though.', '2005-05-12 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381910, 174021, 3032, '<td valign="top">I think a little bit of fill flash (with a lot of negative flash exposute compensation) wouldn''t hurt here. Might give a little bit more contrast on the subjects. Might also bring out the viewers faces a bit more to give a spooky feel. their faces are only just visible and not recognizable as such without some effort. 7<br/></td>', 'I think a little bit of fill flash (with a lot of negative flash exposute compensation) wouldn''t hurt here. Might give a little bit more contrast on the subjects. Might also bring out the viewers faces a bit more to give a spooky feel. their faces are only just visible and not recognizable as such without some effort. 7', '2005-05-12 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381912, 172456, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and well executed. The hand seems very wide for some reason, probably due to the perspective I can''t see in the silhouette. Nice lighting, nice bubbles and a great colour.</td>', 'Excellent idea and well executed. The hand seems very wide for some reason, probably due to the perspective I can''t see in the silhouette. Nice lighting, nice bubbles and a great colour.', '2005-05-12 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381916, 173977, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good one for Silhouettes 2. :)<br/>If it wasn''t for the ''broken'' arm (with the light) I''d almost think they were in front of the curtain.<br/>It looks great, very smooth gradation of light. Nice angle as well, shot almost from the floor?</td>', 'Good one for Silhouettes 2. :)If it wasn''t for the ''broken'' arm (with the light) I''d almost think they were in front of the curtain.It looks great, very smooth gradation of light. Nice angle as well, shot almost from the floor?', '2005-05-12 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381918, 173500, 4411, '<td valign="top">Without the hand I think I would have really liked this shot, but the hand and the very rough editing on &amp; around it just keeps drawing my attention.</td>', 'Without the hand I think I would have really liked this shot, but the hand and the very rough editing on & around it just keeps drawing my attention.', '2005-05-12 17:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381919, 174585, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Like the rich blues and oranges. Peaceful shot.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Like the rich blues and oranges. Peaceful shot.', '2005-05-12 17:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381923, 174530, 3032, '<td valign="top">Softness makes it dreamy. The green objects in front is what makes it work for me, I''m less interested in the top half. The dark blue and greens look great, the average tones of the top half do nothing. 7</td>', 'Softness makes it dreamy. The green objects in front is what makes it work for me, I''m less interested in the top half. The dark blue and greens look great, the average tones of the top half do nothing. 7', '2005-05-12 17:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381927, 174650, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fun title. Made me smile. I like the simplicity of this.</td>', 'Fun title. Made me smile. I like the simplicity of this.', '2005-05-12 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381928, 174364, 3032, '<td valign="top">The face in the fence (this particular version is ''kippengaas'' in Dutch) isn''t that shocking, but the fierce red of the lipstick is. :)<br/></td>', 'The face in the fence (this particular version is ''kippengaas'' in Dutch) isn''t that shocking, but the fierce red of the lipstick is. :)', '2005-05-12 17:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381933, 174301, 3032, '<td valign="top">The gradation of the vignetting is a bit hard, but the simpleness of the scene is pleasing. Great sky. I know the topic is dreams, but I am sure I prefer it without the vignetting.</td>', 'The gradation of the vignetting is a bit hard, but the simpleness of the scene is pleasing. Great sky. I know the topic is dreams, but I am sure I prefer it without the vignetting.', '2005-05-12 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381938, 174681, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wet Milkyway. :) 7</td>', 'Wet Milkyway. :) 7', '2005-05-12 18:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381941, 174661, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great effect, very painting-like. I like this style, good subject for it.</td>', 'Great effect, very painting-like. I like this style, good subject for it.', '2005-05-12 18:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381943, 172944, 3032, '<td valign="top">Makes me wanna go on a holiday. :)</td>', 'Makes me wanna go on a holiday. :)', '2005-05-12 18:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381946, 174696, 33068, '<td valign="top">WOW.....love the colors.  So calming!</td>', 'WOW.....love the colors.  So calming!', '2005-05-12 18:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382028, 173923, 4411, '<td valign="top">Superb capture.<br/>Amazing how we spend our childhood playing with these things, then all these years laters find ourselves "playing" with them again by pointing a camera at them.<br/>The blown highlights and slightly muted colours create a mood in this photo which is missing from most. The girl''s expression tops it all off nicely.</td>', 'Superb capture.Amazing how we spend our childhood playing with these things, then all these years laters find ourselves "playing" with them again by pointing a camera at them.The blown highlights and slightly muted colours create a mood in this photo which is missing from most. The girl''s expression tops it all off nicely.', '2005-05-12 18:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382036, 174687, 23203, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is so cool.. creates an optical illusion, while keeping the centre intact. I''d love to find out how you did it.. 10<br/></td>', 'Wow, this is so cool.. creates an optical illusion, while keeping the centre intact. I''d love to find out how you did it.. 10', '2005-05-12 18:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382038, 174400, 23203, '<td valign="top">I''d love to find out how you did it .. this is so cool.. I cant help staring at the optical illusion.. 10</td>', 'I''d love to find out how you did it .. this is so cool.. I cant help staring at the optical illusion.. 10', '2005-05-12 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382039, 174459, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors, hot geyser.. what else does one need to ribbon?</td>', 'Nice rich colors, hot geyser.. what else does one need to ribbon?', '2005-05-12 18:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382042, 174530, 4411, '<td valign="top">Though I really like the colours this is a little too processed for my taste - everything is much too "soft" for me. Compositionally I would lose the right hand side to leave a very strongly framed image. Otherwise it is very well thought out with the plants in the foreground balancing the image out very nicely.</td>', 'Though I really like the colours this is a little too processed for my taste - everything is much too "soft" for me. Compositionally I would lose the right hand side to leave a very strongly framed image. Otherwise it is very well thought out with the plants in the foreground balancing the image out very nicely.', '2005-05-12 18:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382043, 174583, 23203, '<td valign="top">This is really nice - has a nice, dreamy, surreal effect. <br/>I cant lay my finger on exactly why - but I like it a lot.<br/></td>', 'This is really nice - has a nice, dreamy, surreal effect. I cant lay my finger on exactly why - but I like it a lot.', '2005-05-12 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382046, 174305, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice! I''d love to find out how you did this</td>', 'Nice! I''d love to find out how you did this', '2005-05-12 18:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382047, 174216, 23203, '<td valign="top">Really Nice! Where do you have sun at midnight -&gt; North-pole?<br/></td>', 'Really Nice! Where do you have sun at midnight -> North-pole?', '2005-05-12 18:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
