(1382249, 174643, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is one of thoes that I am waiting to see the otcome of.<br/>It symbalises the unknown nightmares that prey in our subconsious and intrigues me on its set up...</td>', 'This is one of thoes that I am waiting to see the otcome of.It symbalises the unknown nightmares that prey in our subconsious and intrigues me on its set up...', '2005-05-12 20:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382253, 174687, 26679, '<td valign="top">zoom blur or zoom effect,. The idea is great , but this one does get my old Minces<br/>(Mince Pies- Eyes) blurring a little</td>', 'zoom blur or zoom effect,. The idea is great , but this one does get my old Minces(Mince Pies- Eyes) blurring a little', '2005-05-12 20:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382303, 172844, 10261, '<td valign="top">The odd colors and over-processed look detract from what might have otherwise been a good image.</td>', 'The odd colors and over-processed look detract from what might have otherwise been a good image.', '2005-05-12 20:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382311, 174224, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your title seems to have a rather disconnected relationship with the accompanying picture. Is that the flower''s natural coloration? I think that you should have gone for a more abstract macro shot of just the brightly colored portion contrasted against the surrounding white petals.</td>', 'Your title seems to have a rather disconnected relationship with the accompanying picture. Is that the flower''s natural coloration? I think that you should have gone for a more abstract macro shot of just the brightly colored portion contrasted against the surrounding white petals.', '2005-05-12 21:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382317, 172574, 10261, '<td valign="top">It would be easier to appreciate this if the image was larger. I don''t think that the portrait orientation works particularly well for this subject.</td>', 'It would be easier to appreciate this if the image was larger. I don''t think that the portrait orientation works particularly well for this subject.', '2005-05-12 21:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382326, 174083, 10261, '<td valign="top">The rich textures brought out by the sepia tones are my favorite part of the image. My least favorite aspect is the writing on the sail. I''m sure that it would have earned you more than a few complaints about the crop, but I would have preferred this image if it was cropped just a bit below the letters and included more horizon off to the sides.</td>', 'The rich textures brought out by the sepia tones are my favorite part of the image. My least favorite aspect is the writing on the sail. I''m sure that it would have earned you more than a few complaints about the crop, but I would have preferred this image if it was cropped just a bit below the letters and included more horizon off to the sides.', '2005-05-12 21:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382329, 174585, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of rich, earthy colors. However, I don''t particularly care for the strong shadow behind the stoneware pot. I think that you would have been able to cut through a lot of the haze that''s visible against the land rising up on the other side of the water if you had used a UV filter.</td>', 'I like the combination of rich, earthy colors. However, I don''t particularly care for the strong shadow behind the stoneware pot. I think that you would have been able to cut through a lot of the haze that''s visible against the land rising up on the other side of the water if you had used a UV filter.', '2005-05-12 21:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382332, 174535, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract. Is it a piece of plastic and cactus leaves?</td>', 'I like the abstract. Is it a piece of plastic and cactus leaves?', '2005-05-12 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382337, 173619, 10261, '<td valign="top">This would have looked less like an upside-down camera and you standing on the floor if your legs were bent somewhat at the knees. Textures or bright lights streaking past in the background would also have helped with the illusion.</td>', 'This would have looked less like an upside-down camera and you standing on the floor if your legs were bent somewhat at the knees. Textures or bright lights streaking past in the background would also have helped with the illusion.', '2005-05-12 21:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382341, 174583, 10261, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and overall composition are good, but I dislike the ''I used NeatImage to scrub all of the details out'' feel that this image has.</td>', 'The soft focus and overall composition are good, but I dislike the ''I used NeatImage to scrub all of the details out'' feel that this image has.', '2005-05-12 21:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382355, 174320, 10261, '<td valign="top">There seems to be glare which washes out the center of the image. I don''t generally care for photographs which are so saturated, but it seems appropriate in this case. I think that the image would have been stronger if the tree trunk and brown grass had been cropped out of the foreground. Alternatively, if you''d have rendered the periphery of the image (including the tree and dead grass) in B&amp;W and only saturated the center of the image, the contrast between the "real world" and the enchanted forest would have been heightened. I''m not sure that editing like this is possible within Advanced editing rules, but it would be worth investigating.</td>', 'There seems to be glare which washes out the center of the image. I don''t generally care for photographs which are so saturated, but it seems appropriate in this case. I think that the image would have been stronger if the tree trunk and brown grass had been cropped out of the foreground. Alternatively, if you''d have rendered the periphery of the image (including the tree and dead grass) in B&W and only saturated the center of the image, the contrast between the "real world" and the enchanted forest would have been heightened. I''m not sure that editing like this is possible within Advanced editing rules, but it would be worth investigating.', '2005-05-12 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382369, 174077, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is one of many photographs in the challenge which interpreted the challenge topic of "Dreams" as "Aspirations". I share your desire to be a good photographer, but a shot featuring a rather simplistic presentation of a camera and related reading material feels more like a product photograph in a catalog than a sincere attempt to produce a strong or creative image.<br/></td>', 'This is one of many photographs in the challenge which interpreted the challenge topic of "Dreams" as "Aspirations". I share your desire to be a good photographer, but a shot featuring a rather simplistic presentation of a camera and related reading material feels more like a product photograph in a catalog than a sincere attempt to produce a strong or creative image.', '2005-05-12 21:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382374, 173431, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, but neither the title nor the subject matter do much to convince me that this is relevant to the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a nice image, but neither the title nor the subject matter do much to convince me that this is relevant to the challenge topic.', '2005-05-12 21:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382381, 174581, 10261, '<td valign="top">If you were going for scary or bizarre you might have been better off cropping this in a way that removed the feathers. The light is not particularly good, as the subject (the turkey''s face and palea) is somewhat in shadow and his back seems to be highlighted.</td>', 'If you were going for scary or bizarre you might have been better off cropping this in a way that removed the feathers. The light is not particularly good, as the subject (the turkey''s face and palea) is somewhat in shadow and his back seems to be highlighted.', '2005-05-12 21:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382397, 174391, 10261, '<td valign="top">This photograph has a rather surreal feel to it, which I kind of like. On a technical note, the way the scene is lit is not particularly good at directing my attention toward the interesting parts of the image. The white wall on the left is dramatically brighter than anything else in the image, while the room beyond is relatively dark. The strong difference in brightness combined with the strong dividing line of the door frame makes this feel almost like two separate images. Without the other side of the door frame on the right side of the image to anchor the scene, I''d be tempted to think that this picture contained two unrelated compositions.<br/></td>', 'This photograph has a rather surreal feel to it, which I kind of like. On a technical note, the way the scene is lit is not particularly good at directing my attention toward the interesting parts of the image. The white wall on the left is dramatically brighter than anything else in the image, while the room beyond is relatively dark. The strong difference in brightness combined with the strong dividing line of the door frame makes this feel almost like two separate images. Without the other side of the door frame on the right side of the image to anchor the scene, I''d be tempted to think that this picture contained two unrelated compositions.', '2005-05-12 21:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382400, 172944, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that you might have emphasized the scene a bit more if the sun were somewhat more occluded. As it is, the brightness difference between the sun and the rest of the image is so large that my eyes keep going back to the sun, even though I know that there''s nothing interesting in that part of the picture.</td>', 'I think that you might have emphasized the scene a bit more if the sun were somewhat more occluded. As it is, the brightness difference between the sun and the rest of the image is so large that my eyes keep going back to the sun, even though I know that there''s nothing interesting in that part of the picture.', '2005-05-12 22:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382407, 172590, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about this image feels overly posed. The contents of the window behind the bench are distracting, and contribute to the feeling that the "western" theme is only an act, without which the image quickly becomes rather uninteresting. The sunglasses hanging from the woman''s collar don''t reinforce the old west theme either.</td>', 'Something about this image feels overly posed. The contents of the window behind the bench are distracting, and contribute to the feeling that the "western" theme is only an act, without which the image quickly becomes rather uninteresting. The sunglasses hanging from the woman''s collar don''t reinforce the old west theme either.', '2005-05-12 22:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382446, 173992, 10261, '<td valign="top">The strong backlight, bland expression on the guy''s face and overly soft focus make this a rather poor shadow of the scene it tries to mimic. I think that the square crop of the image works against you as well. The focal point of the image (even if it isn''t in sharp photographic focus) is the leg, which is horizontal. The repetition of the horizontal theme in the blinds is good (despite the harsh light). The vertical posture of the guy would complement rather than conflict with the theme if the leg were placed higher in the frame (preferably by moving the camera closer to the ground) and making the crop more landscape than square. Even if this results in more negative space, I think that the stronger presentation would more than make up for it.</td>', 'The strong backlight, bland expression on the guy''s face and overly soft focus make this a rather poor shadow of the scene it tries to mimic. I think that the square crop of the image works against you as well. The focal point of the image (even if it isn''t in sharp photographic focus) is the leg, which is horizontal. The repetition of the horizontal theme in the blinds is good (despite the harsh light). The vertical posture of the guy would complement rather than conflict with the theme if the leg were placed higher in the frame (preferably by moving the camera closer to the ground) and making the crop more landscape than square. Even if this results in more negative space, I think that the stronger presentation would more than make up for it.', '2005-05-12 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382456, 173541, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that the placement of the apparition relative to the pole in the background helps to obscure one of the main elements of this photograph. I like the placement of the figure on the left of the frame approaching the sign. There''s probably little you could have done about the light on the near side of the building, but having that turned off or covered up for even half of the exposure would have helped to even out the light. I like the feel of the tracks and the roof line receding into the distance. The composition may have been stronger if taken at an angle which emphasized the track a bit more (e.g taken from a bit farther back and turned slightly more toward the vanishing point) and showed the figure walking away from the camera toward the distant horizon.</td>', 'I think that the placement of the apparition relative to the pole in the background helps to obscure one of the main elements of this photograph. I like the placement of the figure on the left of the frame approaching the sign. There''s probably little you could have done about the light on the near side of the building, but having that turned off or covered up for even half of the exposure would have helped to even out the light. I like the feel of the tracks and the roof line receding into the distance. The composition may have been stronger if taken at an angle which emphasized the track a bit more (e.g taken from a bit farther back and turned slightly more toward the vanishing point) and showed the figure walking away from the camera toward the distant horizon.', '2005-05-12 22:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382478, 174681, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if the water droplets were a bit sharper. More negative space or a narrower DOF might have helped as well. Although this makes an interesting abstract, it might have been more interesting if the drops were flying toward / colliding with something.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if the water droplets were a bit sharper. More negative space or a narrower DOF might have helped as well. Although this makes an interesting abstract, it might have been more interesting if the drops were flying toward / colliding with something.', '2005-05-12 22:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382479, 174216, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely and magical. Bumping up.</td>', 'Lovely and magical. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382484, 173644, 22734, '<td valign="top">very highly creative and very original. Bumping up.</td>', 'very highly creative and very original. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382487, 173097, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the light on the man''s face seems a bit too harsh.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the light on the man''s face seems a bit too harsh.', '2005-05-12 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382488, 174691, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great effect. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great effect. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382494, 173992, 22734, '<td valign="top">Interesting recreation with that gream-like feel. Bumping up.</td>', 'Interesting recreation with that gream-like feel. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382496, 174643, 22734, '<td valign="top">An outstanding and bizarre entry. Convincing job. Bumping up.</td>', 'An outstanding and bizarre entry. Convincing job. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382509, 174305, 10261, '<td valign="top"><br/>This is an interesting abstract. I like the feel of the image, but I would have preferred a slightly less cluttered view of the outside. Did the blur come from the light being distorted by the tunnel, or was the picture taped to the end of the tube while the camera was rotated? I like the effect, but I think that (if the latter procedure mentioned above were used) moving the camera forward with the image taped onto the tube may have resulted an a more interesting ''moving yet staying still'' feeling.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. I like the feel of the image, but I would have preferred a slightly less cluttered view of the outside. Did the blur come from the light being distorted by the tunnel, or was the picture taped to the end of the tube while the camera was rotated? I like the effect, but I think that (if the latter procedure mentioned above were used) moving the camera forward with the image taped onto the tube may have resulted an a more interesting ''moving yet staying still'' feeling.', '2005-05-12 22:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382518, 173353, 22734, '<td valign="top">Fastastic vortex. Bumping up.</td>', 'Fastastic vortex. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382519, 174021, 22734, '<td valign="top">Extremely exciting and captured with  dream like lighting. Bumping up.</td>', 'Extremely exciting and captured with  dream like lighting. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382520, 174695, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''m interested in learning how you produced the ''dream bubble''. But aside from my curiosity about your technique, this seems like little more than an elaborate excuse for a pet photograph.</td>', 'I''m interested in learning how you produced the ''dream bubble''. But aside from my curiosity about your technique, this seems like little more than an elaborate excuse for a pet photograph.', '2005-05-12 22:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382524, 172944, 22734, '<td valign="top">Certainly a dream image with those warm soothing tones. Bumping up.</td>', 'Certainly a dream image with those warm soothing tones. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382526, 173097, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great lighting to exude that dream feeling. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great lighting to exude that dream feeling. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382529, 174308, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect with that nightmare look. Another bump.</td>', 'Very nice effect with that nightmare look. Another bump.', '2005-05-12 22:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382530, 174693, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good presentation and lovely b/w. Bumping up.</td>', 'Good presentation and lovely b/w. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382534, 173989, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition with lovely bofy angles. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice composition with lovely bofy angles. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382538, 172150, 22734, '<td valign="top">Alone, left to dream. Bumping up.</td>', 'Alone, left to dream. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382541, 174546, 22734, '<td valign="top">A good concept. Bumping up.</td>', 'A good concept. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382542, 174208, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great dream vortex effect and a good b/w choice. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great dream vortex effect and a good b/w choice. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382544, 174576, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image is interesting, but I think that it would have been a bit better if the footprints made their way onto both sides of the frame. This would have been much stronger if, in addition to the footprints, you showed the feet actually walking on the water. Since seeing sand squishing up around the edges of the feet would spoil the effect, having the person suspend themselves from a nearby pier or something would allow you to have their feet in contact with nothing but the water.</td>', 'This image is interesting, but I think that it would have been a bit better if the footprints made their way onto both sides of the frame. This would have been much stronger if, in addition to the footprints, you showed the feet actually walking on the water. Since seeing sand squishing up around the edges of the feet would spoil the effect, having the person suspend themselves from a nearby pier or something would allow you to have their feet in contact with nothing but the water.', '2005-05-12 22:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382546, 173977, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very solid and wonderful silhoutte with deeply inherent mystery. Nice treatment.<br/>Bumping up.</td>', 'A very solid and wonderful silhoutte with deeply inherent mystery. Nice treatment.Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 22:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382550, 172694, 22734, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered just a little later to make the light reflection steal the show. However, as is, it is a beautiful and loving image. Bumping up.</td>', 'I would have prefered just a little later to make the light reflection steal the show. However, as is, it is a beautiful and loving image. Bumping up.', '2005-05-12 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382558, 174210, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very interesting as much is left to suggestion rather than visual overkill.<br/></td>', 'Very interesting as much is left to suggestion rather than visual overkill.', '2005-05-12 23:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382559, 173886, 10261, '<td valign="top">If this had been illuminated by flickering flames the shadows might have concealed the lack of detail on the skulls which reveal that they are small, cheep bits of plastic.</td>', 'If this had been illuminated by flickering flames the shadows might have concealed the lack of detail on the skulls which reveal that they are small, cheep bits of plastic.', '2005-05-12 23:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382561, 172456, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice effect as the silhoutte stands out very well.</td>', 'Nice effect as the silhoutte stands out very well.', '2005-05-12 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382570, 174502, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in general, but the umbrella seems rather out of place and prevents me from getting a good look at the focal point of the image. I like the rich green throughout the image, but I think that the scene would have benefited from a little more color disbursed throughout, particularly in the empty-looking space above and behind the umbrella. Good use of DOF and the path to lead my eyes to the focal point of the image.</td>', 'I like the composition in general, but the umbrella seems rather out of place and prevents me from getting a good look at the focal point of the image. I like the rich green throughout the image, but I think that the scene would have benefited from a little more color disbursed throughout, particularly in the empty-looking space above and behind the umbrella. Good use of DOF and the path to lead my eyes to the focal point of the image.', '2005-05-12 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382572, 174485, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully concieved and executed image. Wonderful lighting and good solid black background. Top three pick.</td>', 'Beautifully concieved and executed image. Wonderful lighting and good solid black background. Top three pick.', '2005-05-12 23:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382573, 174546, 5792, '<td valign="top">Most images like this blatantly going for a high score generally are not done well. This is an exceptional image deserving of a ribbon! Hope you get it.</td>', 'Most images like this blatantly going for a high score generally are not done well. This is an exceptional image deserving of a ribbon! Hope you get it.', '2005-05-12 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382574, 172180, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a nice cityscape, but without a clear focal point (e.g. a person in the foreground, a boat on the water) or a little more effort from the title, it seems rather loosely associated with the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a nice cityscape, but without a clear focal point (e.g. a person in the foreground, a boat on the water) or a little more effort from the title, it seems rather loosely associated with the challenge topic.', '2005-05-12 23:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382576, 174077, 5792, '<td valign="top">Top quality, professional image. This would make a great magazine advertisement photograph.  "Camera" images typically do not do well but I hope this one bucks the trend and wins a ribbon.</td>', 'Top quality, professional image. This would make a great magazine advertisement photograph.  "Camera" images typically do not do well but I hope this one bucks the trend and wins a ribbon.', '2005-05-12 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382579, 174364, 5792, '<td valign="top">Incredible concept and very, very moody. This will be a top finisher.</td>', 'Incredible concept and very, very moody. This will be a top finisher.', '2005-05-12 23:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382582, 174497, 5792, '<td valign="top">High quality image. Good color and lighting. The only improvement would be to make the background solid back. Otherwise, beautifully done. You are to be commended.</td>', 'High quality image. Good color and lighting. The only improvement would be to make the background solid back. Otherwise, beautifully done. You are to be commended.', '2005-05-12 23:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382583, 174691, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept and well done. I''m dying to know why there isn''t a pillowcase. Very well done. Should place high.</td>', 'Very interesting concept and well done. I''m dying to know why there isn''t a pillowcase. Very well done. Should place high.', '2005-05-12 23:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382584, 174186, 10261, '<td valign="top">The row of pillars leads my eyes toward the top of the image, while the white pole and piece of cloth draw my attention back to the foreground. A shallower DOF to direct my attention to something in particular, or a more human element (e.g. a shoe, a picture frame with shattered glass) would have helped this image to stand out from the others in the challenge.</td>', 'The row of pillars leads my eyes toward the top of the image, while the white pole and piece of cloth draw my attention back to the foreground. A shallower DOF to direct my attention to something in particular, or a more human element (e.g. a shoe, a picture frame with shattered glass) would have helped this image to stand out from the others in the challenge.', '2005-05-12 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382586, 174083, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic dream. It might not be a sailboat, but we all have our own similar dreams we can identify with you on. Great concept.</td>', 'This is a fantastic dream. It might not be a sailboat, but we all have our own similar dreams we can identify with you on. Great concept.', '2005-05-12 23:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382590, 174609, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''d find this far more interesting of there was some recognizable feature in this image. Even a feverish abstract will have more impact if there was a hint of reality present in the mad wash of colors.</td>', 'I''d find this far more interesting of there was some recognizable feature in this image. Even a feverish abstract will have more impact if there was a hint of reality present in the mad wash of colors.', '2005-05-12 23:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382600, 174484, 10261, '<td valign="top">The faded, old photograph feel works well here. I think that a little less brightness and perhaps some scratches on the image would have enhanced the presentation. The hot spot on the bottom of the apple is a little distracting. The knees bending in the wrong direction is a nice touch, but I can''t help but think that I ought to see your arms (or whatever they''ve become) lying about somewhere. As a surreal photograph this is fairly good. You''re on your own for the interpretation of this dream though.</td>', 'The faded, old photograph feel works well here. I think that a little less brightness and perhaps some scratches on the image would have enhanced the presentation. The hot spot on the bottom of the apple is a little distracting. The knees bending in the wrong direction is a nice touch, but I can''t help but think that I ought to see your arms (or whatever they''ve become) lying about somewhere. As a surreal photograph this is fairly good. You''re on your own for the interpretation of this dream though.', '2005-05-12 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382604, 174571, 10261, '<td valign="top">It looks like they feel asleep while pulling each other''s hair. Ironically, they look rather peaceful. I don''t think that a picture of people sleeping quite fits the challenge, but it''s a cute snapshot.</td>', 'It looks like they feel asleep while pulling each other''s hair. Ironically, they look rather peaceful. I don''t think that a picture of people sleeping quite fits the challenge, but it''s a cute snapshot.', '2005-05-12 23:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382609, 174505, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has some nice things going for it, like the treelines and the dandylions gone to seed. I suspect this is just your camera over which you have no control but the overall general low technical quality hurts this image. I''m unsure the person in the image helps it or not. It might be better without him. The focus is not particularly good either.<br/> <br/>If your camera is capable of doing macro I would recommend retaking this image from ground level with several dandylions closeup in sharp focus and with the treeline and sky behind them in recognizable but soft focus.</td>', 'This image has some nice things going for it, like the treelines and the dandylions gone to seed. I suspect this is just your camera over which you have no control but the overall general low technical quality hurts this image. I''m unsure the person in the image helps it or not. It might be better without him. The focus is not particularly good either. If your camera is capable of doing macro I would recommend retaking this image from ground level with several dandylions closeup in sharp focus and with the treeline and sky behind them in recognizable but soft focus.', '2005-05-12 23:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382613, 174650, 10261, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is overexposed or if my eyes are just having trouble picking out detail because of the really bright sky. The large amount of negative space wouldn''t feel so mis-allocated if I could make out more features in the bottom of the image.</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is overexposed or if my eyes are just having trouble picking out detail because of the really bright sky. The large amount of negative space wouldn''t feel so mis-allocated if I could make out more features in the bottom of the image.', '2005-05-12 23:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382622, 174669, 10261, '<td valign="top">The M&amp;Ms don''t seem to be in very sharp focus. While the lace lends some texture to the image, I think that dry ice clouds curling around the base of the goblet might have made this feel less like a chocolate advertisement.</td>', 'The M&Ms don''t seem to be in very sharp focus. While the lace lends some texture to the image, I think that dry ice clouds curling around the base of the goblet might have made this feel less like a chocolate advertisement.', '2005-05-12 23:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382630, 172457, 5792, '<td valign="top">The concept of this image is very good and I''m surprised no one else thought of it. But the image seems flat and taken from an uninteresting perspective. Unsure what angle it should be taken at but I think you would find you would like it better if you tried photographing it from different angles. I''d also use a little SUBTLE dodge and burn to add more texture to the image and saturate the colors more. I''d definitely clone out whatever that thing sticking up from the front yard in the foreground. It detracts from your concept.</td>', 'The concept of this image is very good and I''m surprised no one else thought of it. But the image seems flat and taken from an uninteresting perspective. Unsure what angle it should be taken at but I think you would find you would like it better if you tried photographing it from different angles. I''d also use a little SUBTLE dodge and burn to add more texture to the image and saturate the colors more. I''d definitely clone out whatever that thing sticking up from the front yard in the foreground. It detracts from your concept.', '2005-05-12 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382636, 174576, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea. All it lacks is good solid focus and clarity. Composition is good.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea. All it lacks is good solid focus and clarity. Composition is good.', '2005-05-12 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382642, 174320, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the concept that you were after... it is a good idea. I''d have cropped just the center of the image where it is most ''enchanted'' and tried for a very soft, dreamlike focus. There are good examples of what you want that are previous ribbon winners. It would benefit you to locate some of those previous winners and contact the photographers to see how they achieved their success. In fact, I''d like to learn how to do those well myself. :)</td>', 'Like the concept that you were after... it is a good idea. I''d have cropped just the center of the image where it is most ''enchanted'' and tried for a very soft, dreamlike focus. There are good examples of what you want that are previous ribbon winners. It would benefit you to locate some of those previous winners and contact the photographers to see how they achieved their success. In fact, I''d like to learn how to do those well myself. :)', '2005-05-12 23:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382648, 173514, 5792, '<td valign="top">First impression is that this is more out of focus than soft focused which I''m sure is not your intention. Maybe you were trying something different from the standard longer exposed image with the banks in focus but the strong water flow pattern. However, this one might have bee better if you''d used the standard technique but then duplicated the layer and applied a strong gaussian blur to the duplicated layer, and then reduced the opacity of the blurred layer until it had an overall dreamlike appearance.</td>', 'First impression is that this is more out of focus than soft focused which I''m sure is not your intention. Maybe you were trying something different from the standard longer exposed image with the banks in focus but the strong water flow pattern. However, this one might have bee better if you''d used the standard technique but then duplicated the layer and applied a strong gaussian blur to the duplicated layer, and then reduced the opacity of the blurred layer until it had an overall dreamlike appearance.', '2005-05-12 23:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382649, 174585, 5792, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image. Makes the viewer wish they were there.</td>', 'A wonderful image. Makes the viewer wish they were there.', '2005-05-12 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382653, 174446, 5792, '<td valign="top">Taken like a true ex-smoker! Great concept. Very funny. Ther is just a little haloing along some primary edges and jaggies most visible where it says "Smoking".</td>', 'Taken like a true ex-smoker! Great concept. Very funny. Ther is just a little haloing along some primary edges and jaggies most visible where it says "Smoking".', '2005-05-12 23:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382665, 174581, 13772, '<td valign="top">Man that is one ugly turkey. Nice capture and good luck! 8</td>', 'Man that is one ugly turkey. Nice capture and good luck! 8', '2005-05-12 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382669, 174364, 13772, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and creative capture. Good luck. 6</td>', 'Nice composition and creative capture. Good luck. 6', '2005-05-13 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382670, 174290, 13772, '<td valign="top">This dosen''t do much for me but it does have that dream like haze to it. I will be interested to see how you did this. 5</td>', 'This dosen''t do much for me but it does have that dream like haze to it. I will be interested to see how you did this. 5', '2005-05-13 00:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382671, 174083, 13772, '<td valign="top">The sepida is very interesting, gives it a different feeling. Good choice and good luck! 7</td>', 'The sepida is very interesting, gives it a different feeling. Good choice and good luck! 7', '2005-05-13 00:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382672, 173867, 10261, '<td valign="top">If I could find a picture of the image that your title eludes to I might be better able to appreciate this photograph. Your model seems to be looking at something, but not intently or emotively enough for me to really be interested in what it might be. The jewelry and watch that she''s wearing are somewhat distracting, and the strong light and her dark clothing make her look rather pale. A shallower DOF centered on the girl would have helped to direct my attention to her (as it is, I''m distracted by the odd shadow that makes it look like there''s a face on the ground behind her head). Taking this photograph on a more overcast day would have helped to soften the light.<br/></td>', 'If I could find a picture of the image that your title eludes to I might be better able to appreciate this photograph. Your model seems to be looking at something, but not intently or emotively enough for me to really be interested in what it might be. The jewelry and watch that she''s wearing are somewhat distracting, and the strong light and her dark clothing make her look rather pale. A shallower DOF centered on the girl would have helped to direct my attention to her (as it is, I''m distracted by the odd shadow that makes it look like there''s a face on the ground behind her head). Taking this photograph on a more overcast day would have helped to soften the light.', '2005-05-13 00:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382680, 174697, 13772, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. I find the upper right a little distracting so you might try a crop. Nice work and good luck. 8</td>', 'Nice close up. I find the upper right a little distracting so you might try a crop. Nice work and good luck. 8', '2005-05-13 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382688, 172457, 10261, '<td valign="top">The focus seems sharpest on the tree, which I trust is not the "special home" that the title refers to. The tree branch blocks my view of the top part of the house, which seems to be the most prominent architectural feature. I think that this photograph might have been better if it was taken from a different perspective; as it is I see a lot of angles, but I don''t really feel like I know what the house looks like.</td>', 'The focus seems sharpest on the tree, which I trust is not the "special home" that the title refers to. The tree branch blocks my view of the top part of the house, which seems to be the most prominent architectural feature. I think that this photograph might have been better if it was taken from a different perspective; as it is I see a lot of angles, but I don''t really feel like I know what the house looks like.', '2005-05-13 00:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382697, 174643, 34114, '<td valign="top">I love this. great idea and nicely executed.</td>', 'I love this. great idea and nicely executed.', '2005-05-13 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382702, 173977, 34114, '<td valign="top">very mysterious. the colour and curtain add to the feel.</td>', 'very mysterious. the colour and curtain add to the feel.', '2005-05-13 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382705, 174664, 34114, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and crop here.</td>', 'I like the idea and crop here.', '2005-05-13 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382708, 172853, 33361, '<td valign="top">back to bump this one up...moody and wonderful 8</td>', 'back to bump this one up...moody and wonderful 8', '2005-05-13 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382709, 173338, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very neat mood and reflections. Nice composition.</td>', 'Very neat mood and reflections. Nice composition.', '2005-05-13 00:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382711, 172293, 33361, '<td valign="top">back to move this one up the scale a bit...it''s really fabulous 9</td>', 'back to move this one up the scale a bit...it''s really fabulous 9', '2005-05-13 00:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382715, 174083, 33361, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop looking at this fabulous image...the tones are wonderful 9</td>', 'I can''t stop looking at this fabulous image...the tones are wonderful 9', '2005-05-13 00:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382716, 174248, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about the props make this look like a snapshot of a scene in a school play. Your model''s posture and facial expression make it look like she''s quietly resigned herself to whatever is about to happen. Since it looks like things are not going well for her, this picture would be stronger if she showed more emotion. Since the eyes and mouth are two important sources of emotional queues, blindfolding your model reduces my ability to sympathize with her. Increasing the amount of light on her face would improve the shot as well.</td>', 'Something about the props make this look like a snapshot of a scene in a school play. Your model''s posture and facial expression make it look like she''s quietly resigned herself to whatever is about to happen. Since it looks like things are not going well for her, this picture would be stronger if she showed more emotion. Since the eyes and mouth are two important sources of emotional queues, blindfolding your model reduces my ability to sympathize with her. Increasing the amount of light on her face would improve the shot as well.', '2005-05-13 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382717, 174083, 34114, '<td valign="top">I like the tones...gives the photo that aged look.</td>', 'I like the tones...gives the photo that aged look.', '2005-05-13 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382724, 172944, 34114, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, perfect composition.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, perfect composition.', '2005-05-13 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382725, 174305, 34114, '<td valign="top">clever idea and nice effect.</td>', 'clever idea and nice effect.', '2005-05-13 00:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382726, 174459, 10261, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the ghostly figure on the path in front of the blast of water. Because their red shirt blends in so well with the orange hillside, their shoes were the thing that caught my eye. This image would be a bit more dream-like if the figure was more prominent.</td>', 'I almost missed the ghostly figure on the path in front of the blast of water. Because their red shirt blends in so well with the orange hillside, their shoes were the thing that caught my eye. This image would be a bit more dream-like if the figure was more prominent.', '2005-05-13 00:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382730, 174546, 34114, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I wouldn''t mind being shackled by those other two ribbons, though.</td>', 'Good idea. I wouldn''t mind being shackled by those other two ribbons, though.', '2005-05-13 00:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382740, 172293, 34114, '<td valign="top">I wish my lilies would glow like that. Good idea.</td>', 'I wish my lilies would glow like that. Good idea.', '2005-05-13 00:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382743, 172150, 10261, '<td valign="top">I feel like the item in his hand should give me some clue as to why he looks so forlorn, but I can''t make out what it is.</td>', 'I feel like the item in his hand should give me some clue as to why he looks so forlorn, but I can''t make out what it is.', '2005-05-13 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382744, 174576, 34114, '<td valign="top">nice composition and use of light.</td>', 'nice composition and use of light.', '2005-05-13 00:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382746, 173514, 34114, '<td valign="top">You created an atmosphere that most of us have experienced!</td>', 'You created an atmosphere that most of us have experienced!', '2005-05-13 00:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382748, 174695, 34114, '<td valign="top">Thats cute...good idea</td>', 'Thats cute...good idea', '2005-05-13 00:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382749, 174210, 34114, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2005-05-13 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382751, 172574, 34114, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and colours.</td>', 'Nice textures and colours.', '2005-05-13 00:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382753, 173344, 34114, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2005-05-13 00:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382779, 172472, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept, well done.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Very nice concept, well done.  Bumping up!', '2005-05-13 00:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382783, 174530, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very pretty--great colors, love the softness.  Bumping up!</td>', 'Very pretty--great colors, love the softness.  Bumping up!', '2005-05-13 00:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382796, 174505, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like this concept a lot.  A couple of things might have improved it and made it more a dream--some softening, or better yet a soft glow, and a bit different posture by the person.  It looks here like a candid, but if you had posed the person, perhaps looking anywhere but down, and without carrying anything (unless you wanted to give him a lot of stuff to carry and make it a burden!).  If you can, I think this would be wonderful for a reshoot!   Nice work, would love to see any other versions you create!</td>', 'I like this concept a lot.  A couple of things might have improved it and made it more a dream--some softening, or better yet a soft glow, and a bit different posture by the person.  It looks here like a candid, but if you had posed the person, perhaps looking anywhere but down, and without carrying anything (unless you wanted to give him a lot of stuff to carry and make it a burden!).  If you can, I think this would be wonderful for a reshoot!   Nice work, would love to see any other versions you create!', '2005-05-13 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1382836, 174301, 8891, '<td valign="top">Many congrats on your first ribbon, Simon!</td>', 'Many congrats on your first ribbon, Simon!', '2005-05-13 01:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382839, 174530, 8891, '<td valign="top">Many congrats on your first ribbon, Ian!</td>', 'Many congrats on your first ribbon, Ian!', '2005-05-13 01:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382843, 173059, 2, '<td valign="top">Can you please set the lens for this shot?  I''d love to know the exact one used.</td>', 'Can you please set the lens for this shot?  I''d love to know the exact one used.', '2005-05-13 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382846, 173059, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congrat''s Christina!  Superb shot.  It''s not often I can pick the winning shot!  (Not that the shots I picked aren''t good, but the other voters usually don''t agree with my taste!)</td>', 'Congrat''s Christina!  Superb shot.  It''s not often I can pick the winning shot!  (Not that the shots I picked aren''t good, but the other voters usually don''t agree with my taste!)', '2005-05-13 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382847, 174691, 2, '<td valign="top">Another excellent placing.  Congrats.</td>', 'Another excellent placing.  Congrats.', '2005-05-13 01:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382849, 174691, 8891, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top ten finish, Joey! Great effect here!</td>', 'Congrats on your top ten finish, Joey! Great effect here!', '2005-05-13 01:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382855, 173059, 15207, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for your comments and votes. This ribbon is very exciting for me. I was using a Nikon D70 with a Nikkor 10.5mm fisheye lens. I set it up on a tripod and turned on the timer and then layed down in the flowers, less than a foot from the camera and this is the effect I got. It was a beautiful day and I thought about this challenge as soon as I saw the meadow.</td>', 'Thanks so much for your comments and votes. This ribbon is very exciting for me. I was using a Nikon D70 with a Nikkor 10.5mm fisheye lens. I set it up on a tripod and turned on the timer and then layed down in the flowers, less than a foot from the camera and this is the effect I got. It was a beautiful day and I thought about this challenge as soon as I saw the meadow.', '2005-05-13 01:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382858, 174301, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, good choice of B&amp;W.  Congrats on your first ribbon, of many...</td>', 'Beautiful shot, good choice of B&W.  Congrats on your first ribbon, of many...', '2005-05-13 01:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382867, 173059, 20168, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Blue dreamy world.  Dream on!</td>', 'Congrats on your Blue dreamy world.  Dream on!', '2005-05-13 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382868, 174301, 20168, '<td valign="top">Oh, that more people would learn this deeper life way of serenity under chaos.  Lovely dream B/W entry.  Congrats!</td>', 'Oh, that more people would learn this deeper life way of serenity under chaos.  Lovely dream B/W entry.  Congrats!', '2005-05-13 01:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1382869, 172590, 5792, '<td valign="top">Barbara... congrats on getting a 6. That is the measure of success for me. Nice sepia. I scored it 7.</td>', 'Barbara... congrats on getting a 6. That is the measure of success for me. Nice sepia. I scored it 7.', '2005-05-13 01:15:27.000000', NULL, 0);
