(1383244, 174530, 26679, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone. I am truly chuffed with this result.<br/>The irony  was I only entered this at the last moment, I had gone to bed feeling unwell having not made a submission, but after a few hours I woke up and then could not get back to sleep.<br/> <br/>So to occupy my mind I spent some time editing a number of images I had taken over the previous 7 days. And this was the outcome<br/> <br/>I decided to give it a shot and see as I was a little concerned that it would be knocked for some heavy processing <br/> <br/>I am surprised that this score got me got a ribbon. So as I said to someone a few minutes ago, I will now proudly hang this virtual ribbon on my virtual wall..<br/>Thank to everyone in DPC land.<br/> <br/>Ian<br/> <br/><i>edited to put workflow details with the image info</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-14 10:26:22.</i></td>', 'Thanks to everyone. I am truly chuffed with this result.The irony  was I only entered this at the last moment, I had gone to bed feeling unwell having not made a submission, but after a few hours I woke up and then could not get back to sleep. So to occupy my mind I spent some time editing a number of images I had taken over the previous 7 days. And this was the outcome I decided to give it a shot and see as I was a little concerned that it would be knocked for some heavy processing  I am surprised that this score got me got a ribbon. So as I said to someone a few minutes ago, I will now proudly hang this virtual ribbon on my virtual wall..Thank to everyone in DPC land. Ian edited to put workflow details with the image info', '2005-05-13 08:39:05.000000', '2005-05-14 11:26:22.000000', 0),
(1383248, 174301, 36437, '<td valign="top">Good work...congratulations! I like this shot!!!</td>', 'Good work...congratulations! I like this shot!!!', '2005-05-13 08:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1383256, 173059, 18728, '<td valign="top">Congratulations :) It sure was a "blue ribbon @ first sight" thing.</td>', 'Congratulations :) It sure was a "blue ribbon @ first sight" thing.', '2005-05-13 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1383282, 174693, 35538, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted. I am actually disappointed with how this turned out. I did it VERY last minute. It would have been a lot better if I would have had more time to correctly and evenly clone out the wires holding the stuff above my head. I had this idea for the challenge and really wanted to try it (my inspiration was a pic I saw on here of a guy with fruit or something on a string above his head). Next time I will take more time to clone out the wires and not wait until 5 minutes before the submission deadline! Thanks again, Jordan</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted. I am actually disappointed with how this turned out. I did it VERY last minute. It would have been a lot better if I would have had more time to correctly and evenly clone out the wires holding the stuff above my head. I had this idea for the challenge and really wanted to try it (my inspiration was a pic I saw on here of a guy with fruit or something on a string above his head). Next time I will take more time to clone out the wires and not wait until 5 minutes before the submission deadline! Thanks again, Jordan', '2005-05-13 08:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1383293, 173644, 35021, '<td valign="top">I''m very disappointed to see this shot so far down the ranks!  I scored it a 9.  Great shot!  And excellent post processing! (btw, I thought it was a potatoe, not a rock, haha)</td>', 'I''m very disappointed to see this shot so far down the ranks!  I scored it a 9.  Great shot!  And excellent post processing! (btw, I thought it was a potatoe, not a rock, haha)', '2005-05-13 09:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
