(1383917, 174643, 14773, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  The photoshopping makes it look more like a painting than a photograph, which normally I''m not into, but you''ve done a really good job. It''s steely and cold, like a spirit''s hand across your neck.  Or so I''d imagine.  My only suggestion is a better location next time, the bedroom doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'Very nice work.  The photoshopping makes it look more like a painting than a photograph, which normally I''m not into, but you''ve done a really good job. It''s steely and cold, like a spirit''s hand across your neck.  Or so I''d imagine.  My only suggestion is a better location next time, the bedroom doesn''t seem to fit.', '2005-05-13 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
