(1397072, 174661, 34247, '<td valign="top">Hi there from the critique club.<br/> <br/>Nice shot and spin. It''s chancy but like several other previous commenters, I found it worked for me. Your choice of crop also shows a lot of thought went to this image, and I like the composition not being centered, despite the fact that there is a very strong central image point.<br/> <br/>I agree that the background perhaps is too muddy and could be "balanced" perhaps with lighter tones.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon this week :)</td>', 'Hi there from the critique club. Nice shot and spin. It''s chancy but like several other previous commenters, I found it worked for me. Your choice of crop also shows a lot of thought went to this image, and I like the composition not being centered, despite the fact that there is a very strong central image point. I agree that the background perhaps is too muddy and could be "balanced" perhaps with lighter tones. Congrats on your ribbon this week :)', '2005-05-19 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
