(1432562, 174691, 19708, '<td valign="top"><i>For the lighting I just used a simple 3 point lighing system with a few lamps I stole from around the house.</i> <br/>Love it!<br/> <br/>You KNOW I''m keeping my eye on you young man... and know why too! <img alt="'' . substr(''//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif'', strrpos(''//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif"/></td>', 'For the lighting I just used a simple 3 point lighing system with a few lamps I stole from around the house. Love it! You KNOW I''m keeping my eye on you young man... and know why too! ', '2005-06-04 03:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
