(1558902, 173992, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFLMBOPOF  THIS IS EXCELLENT!!!! I love everything about this.  What a tribute to the classic movie.  Great focus and eye for detail.  Mrs. Robinson is literally rolling over in her grave (Ann Bancroft - may she rest in peace).<br/> <br/>Thanks for the big chuckle. I just stumbled onto this under the humorous category.  GREAT!!!!!</td>', 'ROFLMBOPOF  THIS IS EXCELLENT!!!! I love everything about this.  What a tribute to the classic movie.  Great focus and eye for detail.  Mrs. Robinson is literally rolling over in her grave (Ann Bancroft - may she rest in peace). Thanks for the big chuckle. I just stumbled onto this under the humorous category.  GREAT!!!!!', '2005-07-24 15:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
