(1753914, 173176, 25655, '<td valign="top">How strange, I was sure I left a comment on this one and added it to my favorites, a loooooong time ago.<br/>But I now see that I didn''t.<br/>I love the shallow DOF and all the technicalities, but I love the idea even more, and I love the erotic feel this photo gives, without being rude or vulgar.<br/>I just love the way you see erotices and convey it in your pictures.</td>', 'How strange, I was sure I left a comment on this one and added it to my favorites, a loooooong time ago.But I now see that I didn''t.I love the shallow DOF and all the technicalities, but I love the idea even more, and I love the erotic feel this photo gives, without being rude or vulgar.I just love the way you see erotices and convey it in your pictures.', '2005-10-02 15:41:49.000000', NULL, 0),
