(2119866, 174216, 23855, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. The comp is beautiful, but the house and powerline elements are a tad distracting. The highlights on the edges produce a slightly ''oversharpened'' look. The shot has a ton of potential, and I''m interested to see more work of the same design.<br/> <br/>-Matt.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. The comp is beautiful, but the house and powerline elements are a tad distracting. The highlights on the edges produce a slightly ''oversharpened'' look. The shot has a ton of potential, and I''m interested to see more work of the same design. -Matt.', '2006-02-03 20:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2245778, 174020, 51125, '<td valign="top">Again, the use of light and processing is brilliant.  You really are inspiring me to experiment more with post-processing.  This certainly deserves a higher score but I am quickly learning that edgy work does not get high marks.  Laying down a distinctive style is truly impressive but not always recognized as such.</td>', 'Again, the use of light and processing is brilliant.  You really are inspiring me to experiment more with post-processing.  This certainly deserves a higher score but I am quickly learning that edgy work does not get high marks.  Laying down a distinctive style is truly impressive but not always recognized as such.', '2006-03-21 23:28:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2245790, 174020, 37961, '<td valign="top">Bloody Hell!</td>', 'Bloody Hell!', '2006-03-21 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2330503, 174446, 34659, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate this!  Cool shot - would be interested to know how you accomplished it (I assume that the smokes are much closer to the lens).  I like your sense of humor.</td>', 'I can appreciate this!  Cool shot - would be interested to know how you accomplished it (I assume that the smokes are much closer to the lens).  I like your sense of humor.', '2006-04-20 19:57:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2332834, 174688, 34659, '<td valign="top">Way back when, I scored this a 4.  I must admit that was way too low.  I''ve learned a lot since then and appreciate things a little differently.  It would probably score a 7-8 from me now.  :-)  Love the radial blur and the tack sharp focus of the stamen.  The DOF/perspective of the petals is particularly striking and I think the colors are great.  The crop may be a tad tight, but nice work and apologies for the low ball.</td>', 'Way back when, I scored this a 4.  I must admit that was way too low.  I''ve learned a lot since then and appreciate things a little differently.  It would probably score a 7-8 from me now.  :-)  Love the radial blur and the tack sharp focus of the stamen.  The DOF/perspective of the petals is particularly striking and I think the colors are great.  The crop may be a tad tight, but nice work and apologies for the low ball.', '2006-04-21 13:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2335348, 174688, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SJCarter:</b></div><hr/><i>  It would probably score a 7-8 from me now.  :-)  Love the radial blur and the tack sharp focus of the stamen. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL! I think these days the radial blur would get me a DQ! Funny how the rules haven''t changed but the rules have changed. ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by SJCarter:  It would probably score a 7-8 from me now.  :-)  Love the radial blur and the tack sharp focus of the stamen.  LOL! I think these days the radial blur would get me a DQ! Funny how the rules haven''t changed but the rules have changed. ;-)', '2006-04-22 18:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
